://api.github.com/repos/arshad-shah/portfolio-v4/commits/a1f7318294f2ea1d9eb3cb39284ee9d30f35505b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-08T13:12:47Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-08T13:12:47Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: comprehensive code improvements for performance, accessibility, and SEO\n\nThis commit includes 16 improvements across multiple areas:\n\nPerformance:\n- Move font loading from CSS @import to HTML link tags with preconnect\n- Add bundle chunking for react-vendor, framer-motion, and icons\n- Add image optimization with picture element and explicit dimensions\n\nAccessibility:\n- Add skip-to-content link for keyboard navigation\n- Add main tag ID for skip link target\n- Add ESLint jsx-a11y plugin for accessibility linting\n- Add Error Boundary component for graceful error handling\n\nSEO:\n- Add Twitter Card meta tags to SEO component\n- Extract hardcoded schema.org data to personal.json\n- Add sitemap.xml for search engine crawling\n- Add robots.txt for crawler directives\n- Add Lighthouse CI to GitHub Actions workflow\n\nSecurity:\n- Add rel=noopener,noreferrer to all window.open calls\n- Remove redundant @vitejs/plugin-react (only using SWC)\n\nCode Quality:\n- Refactor scroll logic to use shared scrollToElement utility\n- Add Footer component with navigation and social links\n- Improve type safety using TypeScript satisfies operator\n- Update Personal interface with new schema fields","tree":{"sha":"b2f4da5883f26c6eb63d8e4a8c7a7ed450db8517","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arshad-shah/portfolio-v4/git/trees/b2f4da5883f26c6eb63d8e4a8c7a7ed450db8517"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arshad-shah/portfolio-v4/git/commits/a1f7318294f2ea1d9eb3cb39284ee9d30f35505b","verification":{"payload":"tree b2f4da5883f26c6eb63d8e4a8c7a7ed450db8517\nparent de61311350ff2785d39c872f679d31c095d6267d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1765199567 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1765199567 +0000\n\nfeat: comprehensive code improvements for performance, accessibility, and SEO\n\nThis commit includes 16 improvements across multiple areas:\n\nPerformance:\n- Move font loading from CSS @import to HTML link tags with preconnect\n- Add bundle chunking for react-vendor, framer-motion, and icons\n- Add image optimization with picture element and explicit dimensions\n\nAccessibility:\n- Add skip-to-content link for keyboard navigation\n- Add main tag ID for skip link target\n- Add ESLint jsx-a11y plugin for accessibility linting\n- Add Error Boundary component for graceful error handling\n\nSEO:\n- Add Twitter Card meta tags to SEO component\n- Extract hardcoded schema.org data to personal.json\n- Add sitemap.xml for search engine crawling\n- Add robots.txt for crawler directives\n- Add Lighthouse CI to GitHub Actions workflow\n\nSecurity:\n- Add rel=noopener,noreferrer to all window.open calls\n- Remove redundant @vitejs/plugin-react (only using SWC)\n\nCode Quality:\n- Refactor scroll logic to use shared scrollToElement utility\n- Add Footer component with navigation and social links\n- Improve type safety using TypeScript satisfies operator\n- Update Personal interface with new schema fields\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGU0G6Xo\nJNSKQasaMvu6OCT/YxCb5vZARNvwTADC3qq712grbdruuGBHWX5D1vSjy0txb+cIwN4n4AyCplqE\nmA4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-12-08T13:12:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude