e":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"authoredDate":"2026-01-21T18:02:49Z","committedDate":"2026-01-21T18:02:49Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T21:05:58.694Z","repositoryId":1110666865,"sha":"4c5f09a366fcefb5fba5cab0c2b4d33f8667e9aa"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"pateatlau","providerType":"User"},"email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"authoredDate":"2026-01-21T17:56:40Z","committedDate":"2026-01-21T17:56:40Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"pateatlau","providerType":"User"},"email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T21:05:58.694Z","repositoryId":1110666865,"sha":"9a02844ccb177b3791e6517610c89b01486d9efd"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"pateatlau","providerType":"User"},"email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"authoredDate":"2026-01-21T17:53:10Z","committedDate":"2026-01-21T17:53:10Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"pateatlau","providerType":"User"},"email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T21:05:58.694Z","repositoryId":1110666865,"sha":"608fa2111f42e254be12a473f01f85f2c323eba8"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"pateatlau","providerType":"User"},"email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"authoredDate":"2026-01-21T17:23:17Z","committedDate":"2026-01-21T17:23:17Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"pateatlau","providerType":"User"},"email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T21:05:58.694Z","repositoryId":1110666865,"sha":"71cfe063fc15123e83ac06dcc93e8d482430b7c6"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T21:05:58.694Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/191ec5169009a80d38ed48ef50688fe7a70bf575/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T14:24:36Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T14:24:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: guard against empty CORS_ORIGINS yielding empty allowlist (#133)\n\nProduction deployment on Railway revealed several issues in the API Gateway:\n\n1. CORS config: if CORS_ORIGINS env var is empty or whitespace-only, the\n   parsed array was empty causing all requests to be rejected. Now falls\n   back to localhost defaults (matching the microservice fix in PR #132).\n\n2. trust proxy: Railway (and nginx) sit in front of the API Gateway, so\n   Express must trust the first proxy hop. Without this, req.ip returns\n   the internal proxy IP and express-rate-limit throws\n   ERR_ERL_UNEXPECTED_X_FORWARDED_FOR on every request.\n\n3. Rate limiter IPv6: express-rate-limit v8 requires custom keyGenerators\n   to call ipKeyGenerator() for IPv6 normalisation. Both authRateLimiter\n   and oauthRateLimiter now use it, fixing ERR_ERL_KEY_GEN_IPV6.\n\n4. CORS rejection logging: log the rejected origin and the allowlist to\n   make future CORS debugging faster.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5595efa977ead1221bb3cc6b88c2b14857b4de4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/5595efa977ead1221bb3cc6b88c2b14857b4de4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/191ec5169009a80d38ed48ef50688fe7a70bf575","verification":{"payload":"tree 5595efa977ead1221bb3cc6b88c2b14857b4de4d\nparent 2e6b6bf765c64d1218eac27c7394511930632bbb\nauthor Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl <pateatlau@gmail.com> 1773843876 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773843876 +0530\n\nfix: guard against empty CORS_ORIGINS yielding empty allowlist (#133)\n\nProduction deployment on Railway revealed several issues in the API Gateway:\n\n1. CORS config: if CORS_ORIGINS env var is empty or whitespace-only, the\n   parsed array was empty causing all requests to be rejected. Now falls\n   back to localhost defaults (matching the microservice fix in PR #132).\n\n2. trust proxy: Railway (and nginx) sit in front of the API Gateway, so\n   Express must trust the first proxy hop. Without this, req.ip returns\n   the internal proxy IP and express-rate-limit throws\n   ERR_ERL_UNEXPECTED_X_FORWARDED_FOR on every request.\n\n3. Rate limiter IPv6: express-rate-limit v8 requires custom keyGenerators\n   to call ipKeyGenerator() for IPv6 normalisation. Both authRateLimiter\n   and oauthRateLimiter now use it, fixing ERR_ERL_KEY_GEN_IPV6.\n\n4. CORS rejection logging: log the rejected origin and the allowlist to\n   make future CORS debugging faster.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpurWkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOmEQAA2OsV7QRfwCp8iwfseBLYVw\nbdcvRe35OjWh2AhIgvs7VhHMOkkmwyl9sVvwIGFw14p0JtmSKXy4fTIMuWOg6Xqs\nB67Cfq9RMvh/AAoYavIpvjDS8gQMzMJRXOB0pYE81EnW14DXWBYSiFEvPJxytwQw\n5ZZTEC+VmxE0s+UIBxHksuJzjcE/W5/GeoZipaS/s2ETBHj9pzykd