ateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/2e6b6bf765c64d1218eac27c7394511930632bbb"}],"sha":"191ec5169009a80d38ed48ef50688fe7a70bf575","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/191ec5169009a80d38ed48ef50688fe7a70bf575"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/2e6b6bf765c64d1218eac27c7394511930632bbb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T12:52:11Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T12:52:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(prod): microservices reject proxied requests — CORS origin mismatch (#132)\n\n* fix(prod): microservices reject proxied requests — CORS origin mismatch\n\nThe API Gateway proxy forwards the browser''s Origin header to downstream\nmicroservices. All 4 services have hardcoded localhost-only CORS origins,\nso any request from Vercel/production frontends gets rejected with 500.\n\nTwo-layer fix:\n1. Strip Origin and Referer headers in the API Gateway proxy — CORS is\n   the gateway''s responsibility, not the microservices''.\n2. Make CORS origins configurable via CORS_ORIGINS env var in all 4\n   services as defense-in-depth (same pattern as the API Gateway).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: guard against empty CORS_ORIGINS yielding empty allowlist\n\nIf CORS_ORIGINS is set but malformed (e.g. '' , ''), parsing produces an\nempty array which blocks all browser requests. Fall back to defaultOrigins\nwhen the parsed result has no valid entries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e9c337e254211c5888d33d24ea7fc31412566f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/7e9c337e254211c5888d33d24ea7fc31412566f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/2e6b6bf765c64d1218eac27c7394511930632bbb","verification":{"payload":"tree 7e9c337e254211c5888d33d24ea7fc31412566f5\nparent 6d90ac41a5a1c620269866aab473dbb55dd56f71\nauthor Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl <pateatlau@gmail.com> 1773838331 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773838331 +0530\n\nfix(prod): microservices reject proxied requests — CORS origin mismatch (#132)\n\n* fix(prod): microservices reject proxied requests — CORS origin mismatch\n\nThe API Gateway proxy forwards the browser''s Origin header to downstream\nmicroservices. All 4 services have hardcoded localhost-only CORS origins,\nso any request from Vercel/production frontends gets rejected with 500.\n\nTwo-layer fix:\n1. Strip Origin and Referer headers in the API Gateway proxy — CORS is\n   the gateway''s responsibility, not the microservices''.\n2. Make CORS origins configurable via CORS_ORIGINS env var in all 4\n   services as defense-in-depth (same pattern as the API Gateway).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: guard against empty CORS_ORIGINS yielding empty allowlist\n\nIf CORS_ORIGINS is set but malformed (e.g. '' , ''), parsing produces an\nempty array which blocks all browser requests. Fall back to defaultOrigins\nwhen the parsed result has no valid entries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpup/7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxh8QADBi+by0jFG0204+YWSVB11w\ngO4nMQgrj9EuK5dKZMXuI/2ei1hLLcDCShEaM8Mu8NUD+rFfkLYIqr5PTaQUUSrX\nnfzF0vSAIlfnqEpslYjsE/zScu5v2DIAvEDfrDnRnmgSojn5uY8o2+8uEHLpcWZm\nCW4cp5+3fM+X+iIqDD8Hkvv9+q9P/PKF5W1l5gp0qsz2pZzEZUgVZMNZwGPpWg0S\n76Y89RT5VSX+Nu4GKWyR/1ue2Mqn6if58qdhwCDtkT+gTOidGriXk3+js8I4iy7c\nl5NG8bJfeugP6YT45QGWIYSME3S94MBXNPv75x/0Lw4afrH3tHETbioBppLU8rHd\n0+r0nBEkw+XvqC3PYSHKfaTwb9gL/nlw1Ko89Ya8t1mbuXI7A7xZ4EDKStJ9nygN\n8wqWO98UfR4qkHVEPIoeF61PoL0Sp9uC7wmq4Ec7lsoB3mz7R56aBz2Zj+A60rXv\nQbjNMRq5kiy+lig1sojsojb/oUVV6vgRgPvMaPaxWVwgHBWW+ukBZo7s8c19Eq6f\nn9NWxKB5YMrEZDZWVh3l7mWLEOEeYUOmBJJBmflZEKr7CMiWuDQfhVp1KfDXPY2q\nd+7PurFKBwotvEmqU30o44VtqDQAZ8ZzdcvAV4BLu4K5fPb5+xXN/icfeYGTj+P1\nVPsVqyywoT4q7b7POtSv\n=JS0b\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-18T12:52:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commit/2e6b6bf765c64d1218eac27c7394511930632bbb","node_id":"C_kwDOQjNucdoAKDJlNmI2YmY3NjVjNjRkMTIxOGVhYzI3YzczOTQ1MTE5MzA2MzJiYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commit/6d90ac41a5a1c620269866aab473dbb55dd56f71","sha":"6d90ac41a5a1c620269866aab473dbb55dd56f71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/6d90ac41a5a1c620269866aab473dbb55dd56f71"}],"sha":"2e6b6bf765c64d1218eac27c7394511930632bbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/2e6b6bf765c64d1218eac27c7394511930632bbb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/6d90ac41a5a1c620269866aab473dbb55dd56f71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T10:10:33Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T10:10:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(prod): Railway 502 — PORT env var mismatch and GraphQL resolver paths (#131)\n\nRailway dynamically assigns a port via the PORT env var and routes traffic\nto it. Three services (API Gateway, Auth, Admin) only read their\nservice-specific port vars (API_GATEWAY_PORT, AUTH_SERVICE_PORT,\nADMIN_SERVICE_PORT), ignoring Railway''s PORT — causing 502.\n\nFix: Read PORT first, fall back to service-specific var, then Zod default.\n\nAlso fix GraphQL resolver paths for admin and profile services — resolvers\nwere calling /admin/* and /profile/* but these services mount routes at\n/api/admin/* and /api/profile/* respectively.\n\nAlso fix TS6059 rootDir errors in all 5 backend tsconfig.app.json by\nsetting rootDir to repo root, allowing cross-project lib imports.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b5eb1aa764ed7d0194985db30c2e0f9f691307c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/9b5eb1aa764ed7d0194985db30c2e0f9f691307c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/6d90ac41a5a1c620269866aab473dbb55dd56f71","verification":{"payload":"tree 9b5eb1aa764ed7d0194985db30c2e0f9f691307c\nparent a13ee72c25503903ac222d8ccda44e82ab031fd6\nauthor Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl <pateatlau@gmail.com> 1773828633 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773828633 +0530\n\nfix(prod): Railway 502 — PORT env var mismatch and GraphQL resolver paths (#131)\n\nRailway dynamically assigns a port via the PORT env var and routes traffic\nto it. Three services (API Gateway, Auth, Admin) only read their\nservice-specific port vars (API_GATEWAY_PORT, AUTH_SERVICE_PORT,\nADMIN_SERVICE_PORT), ignoring Railway''s PORT — causing 502.\n\nFix: Read PORT first, fall back to service-specific var, then Zod default.\n\nAlso fix GraphQL resolver paths for admin and profile services — resolvers\nwere calling /admin/* and /profile/* but these services mount routes at\n/api/admin/* and /api/profile/* respectively.\n\nAlso fix TS6059 rootDir errors in all 5 backend tsconfig.app.json by\nsetting rootDir to repo root, allowing cross-project lib imports.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpunoZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADbAQAGL5Y1QV73NVQLWKPdzGWsZr\nOorP3j8ZH8fgLNIYWhvVfFJpu0y8nO7JUVLdtoQlKZABzfkGhQJBCpwepkkrlumR\n0rfh/vjDF+kkpPX0lG4M0PVJLAmT+mm15dyAF+y5+jZ7Ft9g0+r9hS5yaB0j+R1t\nTHqOiPTmysOiSKi9zhoimkiKILrrgMzwin0SGttbky1hSGQU5WIJHjQGTbfqc0qT\nR7AE/d13mRoUzRFRqD8X7zy17+txURBzm8qfcIdvwU4Vgnk4OnKR5cfm2JIKZvgA\nyKqNG6sL9Aiu2nDG9Qs3zpHFa50d8zYW4mpo2qBGXYkWaiwdPeNQQIb+XBfAn+mO\nAcY58kVKv5RDUP9A3lhsZAWNVuEGfhNVh4urtbh/uS/gqgJyq2HVKBWCYu75iN70\nbAjwRU52BqsB2S+VC7RrMD2G10cKJJw0PRay1aPszx0uMJkPAHMykUZ/L5qDLv2z\ndW4aO3v9Eg0AeEo5NO45hNRhaV6noWG0KKOnCzG4rw7gqu38h3aSrSJNlvMy+NQB\n9Gz15hpLMNYlkoE026BbJO+q8H70HhpFf6/VG6hECiRkF9g5JEGLICLo1b8/icQG\nyC6dytgAWZnMYhvih/o3VgYveB0LRDVIPrSB2D9c7Qzz1gXa/nSjdUjsofOCFAI0\naOhlpfHXKa69ArezHP+Z\n=bGfy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-18T10:10:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.g