sers/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/a13ee72c25503903ac222d8ccda44e82ab031fd6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T08:48:55Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T08:48:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(prod): SPA routing 404 and API Gateway 502 on Railway (#130)\n\n* fix(prod): SPA routing 404 and API Gateway 502 on Railway\n\nSPA routing (404 on direct /signin, /signup navigation):\n- Add Vercel rewrite rule matching paths without extensions\n  (/((?!.*\\.).*) -> /index.html) leaving JS/CSS chunks untouched\n\nAPI Gateway 502 Bad Gateway on all auth/payments/admin/profile calls:\n- proxy-routes.ts hardcoded ''host: localhost'' and never read config.services\n  -- wired up parseServiceUrl() to read AUTH_SERVICE_URL, PAYMENTS_SERVICE_URL,\n     ADMIN_SERVICE_URL, PROFILE_SERVICE_URL from validated config\n- graphql/resolvers hardcoded localhost:PORT instead of using config.services\n  -- replaced with config.services.auth/payments/admin/profile base URLs\n\nOn Railway set service env vars on the API Gateway:\n  AUTH_SERVICE_URL=http://<service>.railway.internal:3001\n  PAYMENTS_SERVICE_URL=http://<service>.railway.internal:3002\n  ADMIN_SERVICE_URL=http://<service>.railway.internal:3003\n  PROFILE_SERVICE_URL=http://<service>.railway.internal:3004\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(api-gateway): harden parseServiceUrl with protocol and path validation\n\n- Throw on non-root URLs (path/query/hash) to fail fast on misconfiguration\n  instead of silently dropping them and producing incorrect proxy targets\n- Explicit protocol check (http:/https:) replaces the unsafe string cast,\n  with a clear error for unsupported protocols\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c987b21b5b5508ddc8adf8cb0cd8759d52a058e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/6c987b21b5b5508ddc8adf8cb0cd8759d52a058e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/a13ee72c25503903ac222d8ccda44e82ab031fd6","verification":{"payload":"tree 6c987b21b5b5508ddc8adf8cb0cd8759d52a058e\nparent 03541099932dcd53fafee8457feefa56598f3d1d\nauthor Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl <pateatlau@gmail.com> 1773823735 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773823735 +0530\n\nfix(prod): SPA routing 404 and API Gateway 502 on Railway (#130)\n\n* fix(prod): SPA routing 404 and API Gateway 502 on Railway\n\nSPA routing (404 on direct /signin, /signup navigation):\n- Add Vercel rewrite rule matching paths without extensions\n  (/((?!.*\\.).*) -> /index.html) leaving JS/CSS chunks untouched\n\nAPI Gateway 502 Bad Gateway on all auth/payments/admin/profile calls:\n- proxy-routes.ts hardcoded ''host: localhost'' and never read config.services\n  -- wired up parseServiceUrl() to read AUTH_SERVICE_URL, PAYMENTS_SERVICE_URL,\n     ADMIN_SERVICE_URL, PROFILE_SERVICE_URL from validated config\n- graphql/resolvers hardcoded localhost:PORT instead of using config.services\n  -- replaced with config.services.auth/payments/admin/profile base URLs\n\nOn Railway set service env vars on the API Gateway:\n  AUTH_SERVICE_URL=http://<service>.railway.internal:3001\n  PAYMENTS_SERVICE_URL=http://<service>.railway.internal:3002\n  ADMIN_SERVICE_URL=http://<service>.railway.internal:3003\n  PROFILE_SERVICE_URL=http://<service>.railway.internal:3004\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(api-gateway): harden parseServiceUrl with protocol and path validation\n\n- Throw on non-root URLs (path/query/hash) to fail fast on misconfiguration\n  instead of silently dropping them and producing incorrect proxy targets\n- Explicit protocol check (http:/https:) replaces the unsafe string cast,\n  with a clear error for unsupported protocols\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpumb3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1isQACOorlfoghtI7ZVkDtyar5tI\nLoFsUFhYmzI39Z0TEbhI/XUO9e8xCENdZ7dFOUfFIqDuRF1bfzzpg3EWjBRa6RDc\nbWCDzTKzKfCGe3+eTaDXEMzx7RhaNJcpo3WgTTxvX+jypCWPJYyO60mOJf60ErR4\ni0qWWc8M0zpgKvimMTEhmS+6mMuc2RtQly4rCwod2rK+lPeSvK3S+RlQjTLSuN1j\ndQJEd0YTGDp9BoBbBK5gSCbYmoRmF3wQ+nhSmg/00KCnWJzWTGTLOTV8PjduS0fI\nQ8xrC0dCa/NnP1OxHV/DDjvW9jOxuPTzq349RcU916M1pi9iK+bN8edRofzVXFIA\nF6cBMIn3xbdZeMXenNPxvRHxzmIWR2GT4wNx6sl1kxX1j0/sJP0/9nnrjBfjErxG\nJU/nijrooZqFSkpoCJ0qir/TQ523/7iLROmSkusHhyYWCGl5/8I1EJmyJV6E9xZh\nYLz5+WjrwiDj3hlESbqSmXrk21Y9DkeNHSdSU3aFDZJKE/sfaKYcBRwsywYoPtR9\nlFJ5VEmpD1tHUJHlKtdEIELdFgCwckgbd3xZoviv/jLl4JkU0rVeG7bwunFtYAPy\nVK2TA+OerE5CeCSDtHvNSID1N1mkBgRdG6N0/qaFYB41nvm8jwW3B6f69/7g4Ln3\nxfiBR32VOzrW6b7krE1W\n=8CGh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-18T08:48:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/r