eceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/d92499b0ec039a7482a92f4065cf33aa8dc5aef1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T16:25:31Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T16:25:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(prod): CSS not loading, health check localhost, service worker 404 (#127)\n\n* fix(prod): CSS extraction, health checks, service worker, MFE env vars\n\n- Add CssExtractRspackPlugin to all 5 rspack configs (shell + 4 MFEs) so\n  CSS is extracted to .css files in production instead of being silently\n  dropped (style-loader is dev-only)\n- Add NX_AUTH_MFE_URL, NX_PAYMENTS_MFE_URL, NX_ADMIN_MFE_URL,\n  NX_PROFILE_MFE_URL, NX_ENABLE_SW to shell''s DefinePlugin so they are\n  baked into the bundle at build time\n- Update getDefaultMfeConfigs() to use the NX_*_MFE_URL env vars when\n  present, falling back to localhost paths for local dev — prevents health\n  checks from hitting localhost in production\n- Gate service worker registration behind NX_ENABLE_SW=true flag; sw.js\n  is not generated by the current rspack pipeline so unconditional\n  registration was causing a 404 on every page load\n- Fix TS errors in remote-health-check.ts (index signature bracket access)\n\n* addressed PR comment from CodeRabbit","tree":{"sha":"c3ae6734c7e51b4ea7c92220d25f5cdad0d337c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/c3ae6734c7e51b4ea7c92220d25f5cdad0d337c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/d92499b0ec039a7482a92f4065cf33aa8dc5aef1","verification":{"payload":"tree c3ae6734c7e51b4ea7c92220d25f5cdad0d337c6\nparent e27c85a5d2a9d07a73f5c8e73514ff845c5a88b8\nauthor Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl <pateatlau@gmail.com> 1773764731 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773764731 +0530\n\nfix(prod): CSS not loading, health check localhost, service worker 404 (#127)\n\n* fix(prod): CSS extraction, health checks, service worker, MFE env vars\n\n- Add CssExtractRspackPlugin to all 5 rspack configs (shell + 4 MFEs) so\n  CSS is extracted to .css files in production instead of being silently\n  dropped (style-loader is dev-only)\n- Add NX_AUTH_MFE_URL, NX_PAYMENTS_MFE_URL, NX_ADMIN_MFE_URL,\n  NX_PROFILE_MFE_URL, NX_ENABLE_SW to shell''s DefinePlugin so they are\n  baked into the bundle at build time\n- Update getDefaultMfeConfigs() to use the NX_*_MFE_URL env vars when\n  present, falling back to localhost paths for local dev — prevents health\n  checks from hitting localhost in production\n- Gate service worker registration behind NX_ENABLE_SW=true flag; sw.js\n  is not generated by the current rspack pipeline so unconditional\n  registration was causing a 404 on every page load\n- Fix TS errors in remote-health-check.ts (index signature bracket access)\n\n* addressed PR comment from CodeRabbit","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuYB7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWIUQAEjuBBU44Rnl52A6kNELa6kh\n2wF76YcYDm3eqatkQ36sCkU10QuSxD9P3FYALumiZu9HD4fqBSId03fhrBR+P/KN\nzI2lDioqWaJznu7D2LsLTA9NfHiKrOwUk0f+EfpXHROA9uGJulQe7km+oMI9+lKJ\nevsOEFdKNJ1LMqN+x8sPEim6nIQUZ7PZLTR171EczjrTReo7uB03gzfJbIbrgZB4\nAaAbDP1z9tFZolHNUyzos2W3qeWqXsJ05jh/Ay5tHFcO9ehcQ54zDi9anh7lgFyb\nGhMJU5vDfKPKkcQstl7aC6YwunceqcbNWZ9+/p6rA/bx8gN0gWFwwuvoDABCF572\nk5yzKIXEQYwNSwM2JmGV9Aomc3+vaY59fOPRWf+vgAaop5NUwyVHUy310lUa+Ahg\nVHovIw+lVqauxgxmT