lse,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commit/e3e73407c5e60d7f96ff6db4976827189abf45a9","node_id":"C_kwDOQjNucdoAKGUzZTczNDA3YzVlNjBkN2Y5NmZmNmRiNDk3NjgyNzE4OWFiZjQ1YTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commit/495b13676d7d15abafadfbfd4decd722e4fedb42","sha":"495b13676d7d15abafadfbfd4decd722e4fedb42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/495b13676d7d15abafadfbfd4decd722e4fedb42"}],"sha":"e3e73407c5e60d7f96ff6db4976827189abf45a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/e3e73407c5e60d7f96ff6db4976827189abf45a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/495b13676d7d15abafadfbfd4decd722e4fedb42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T09:00:59Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T09:00:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(shell): use individual MFE URL env vars for Vercel deployment (#122)\n\n* fix(shell): use individual MFE URL env vars for Vercel deployment\n\nShell''s getRemoteUrl() used NX_MFE_BASE_URL with a /mfe/<name>/ path pattern,\nwhich works for nginx in local dev but not for Vercel where each MFE has its\nown unique domain.\n\nFix:\n- Updated getRemoteUrl() to use individual NX_AUTH_MFE_URL, NX_PAYMENTS_MFE_URL,\n  NX_ADMIN_MFE_URL, NX_PROFILE_MFE_URL env vars in production\n- Added Vercel MFE domains to ALLOWED_REMOTE_ORIGINS\n- Added debug logs for MFE URLs during config evaluation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shell): allow CI builds without MFE URL env vars\n\nCI builds run in production mode but don''t need actual MFE URLs since\nthe Shell build artifact won''t be deployed from CI (only from Vercel).\n\nAdded CI detection: if process.env.CI === ''true'' and MFE URL env vars\nare missing, use placeholder URLs with a warning instead of throwing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shell): address CodeRabbit review comments\n\n- Added NX_PROFILE_MFE_URL to .env.example and .env.required\n- Gated config debug logs behind NX_ENABLE_CONFIG_DEBUG feature flag\n- Added Vercel MFE domains to nginx CSP header (script-src and connect-src)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shell): add CI placeholder URL to allowed origins\n\nThe CI placeholder URL (https://placeholder.vercel.app) used when\nNX_*_MFE_URL env vars are missing in CI builds needs to be in\nALLOWED_REMOTE_ORIGINS, otherwise validateRemoteUrls() rejects it.\n\nAdded conditional inclusion of placeholder domain when CI=true.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c840578701d38c97d6568517a3741b3349a0b43d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/c840578701d38c97d6568517a3741b3349a0b43d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/495b13676d7d15abafadfbfd4decd722e4fedb42","verification":{"payload":"tree c840578701d38c97d6568517a3741b3349a0b43d\nparent fe4e7e9399782a52b36573e4ce45caeedab97864\nauthor Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl <pateatlau@gmail.com> 1773738059 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773738059 +0530\n\nfix(shell): use individual MFE URL env vars for Vercel deployment (#122)\n\n* fix(shell): use individual MFE URL env vars for Vercel deployment\n\nShell''s getRemoteUrl() used NX_MFE_BASE_URL with a /mfe/<name>/ path pattern,\nwhich works for nginx in local dev but not for Vercel where each MFE has its\nown unique domain.\n\nFix:\n- Updated getRemoteUrl() to use individual NX_AUTH_MFE_URL, NX_PAYMENTS_MFE_URL,\n  NX_ADMIN_MFE_URL, NX_PROFILE_MFE_URL env vars in production\n- Added Vercel MFE domains to ALLOWED_REMOTE_ORIGINS\n- Added debug logs for MFE URLs during config evaluation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shell): allow CI builds without MFE URL env vars\n\nCI builds run in production mode but don''t need actual MFE URLs since\nthe Shell build artifact won''t be deployed from CI (only from Vercel).\n\nAdded CI detection: if process.env.CI === ''true'' and MFE URL env vars\nare missing, use placeholder URLs with a warning instead of throwing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shell): address CodeRabbit review comments\n\n- Added NX_PROFILE_MFE_URL to .env.example and .env.required\n- Gated config debug logs behind NX_ENABLE_CONFIG_DEBUG feature flag\n- Added Vercel MFE domains to nginx CSP header (script-src and connect-src)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shell): add CI placeholder URL to allowed origins\n\nThe CI placeholder URL (https://placeholder.vercel.app) used when\nNX_*_MFE_URL env vars are missing in CI builds needs to be in\nALLOWED_REMOTE_ORIGINS, otherwise validateRemoteUrls() rejects it.\n\nAdded conditional inclusion of placeholder domain when CI=true.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuRhLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxQgQAJDj2HjdBjEjRYlFeFgoF+e9\nN2/YlVx+0Vmowm4E2Nj/Pd9tmGusHCUvoezGRTUHiPYOBTx8PrZOsyQAdIteZ3/0\nFLYOnX3jT2MN80g84u6qRn0ZrrpUts8Z1olE5rF6ZS5yrOAlTV48v/Yny6icvjcO\nd4dBZTI0NWQnQXqrXbWh/GOt99BqgIbjm+YGEbSlgvqIdYv/+35Qan55KBzMVHyd\nLFejbreaQuNGcToOVY7nhinVUN9o2CSbLfInsb/XO22jXzwy/o0iyi2GCB2Bnu7q\ni29Gy7C4EKuS1afHoqSaf3K3Npdb5b0n4l8dzLrm8EQMiUTCf+h1jW5dBT5r0gcQ\nPzkBr1jbHgkwlQgYuf609WO0bgEAFMxAnsgWw/G4TFIizmBO5XaPjYkGek432iHD\nk4wf2zNsH3Sv5nOr5EPsK2ppHfwf6Ksmmig1E6MGSiueS+4TDy/kFvbnzXcArPSh\nThDrm6B/isnKjdXFCWiwF5qvhohmgozXcII9oOt2ROH3pmfFKHyuS8k4go5kp0HO\nH+dWWLifP1r39P73yWMxu85LQGygB+FZhf0EB+aDIbjxWQqO9/ZaGc90h8H35Ri+\nOuRnPmhwsm1qDBgp9zgvNRowD5H1tD3s5fwJPLLB5DLrBOJ9Zze1nx2i5GgOZg9p\nEemn3hNRimfK8c+tjFYI\n=uLQI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-17T09:01:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"