red_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/fe4e7e9399782a52b36573e4ce45caeedab97864/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T08:16:32Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T08:16:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(rspack): add missing NX_WS_URL and NX_GRAPHQL_URL to DefinePlugin (#121)\n\nbootstrap.tsx in payments/admin/profile MFEs reference process.env[''NX_WS_URL'']\nand process.env[''NX_GRAPHQL_URL''] for WebSocket and GraphQL client initialization.\n\nThese env vars were not defined in DefinePlugin, causing \"process is not defined\"\nruntime errors in production builds where process.env is not available.\n\nFix: Added NX_WS_URL and NX_GRAPHQL_URL to DefinePlugin in all 4 MFE rspack configs.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"644a7ef5e40f4370c4c7e03e4212bcd182b8cc9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/644a7ef5e40f4370c4c7e03e4212bcd182b8cc9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/fe4e7e9399782a52b36573e4ce45caeedab97864","verification":{"payload":"tree 644a7ef5e40f4370c4c7e03e4212bcd182b8cc9a\nparent 5f29a5d6fad9208e39acb72e2f0dff481a4773ae\nauthor Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl <pateatlau@gmail.com> 1773735392 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773735392 +0530\n\nfix(rspack): add missing NX_WS_URL and NX_GRAPHQL_URL to DefinePlugin (#121)\n\nbootstrap.tsx in payments/admin/profile MFEs reference process.env[''NX_WS_URL'']\nand process.env[''NX_GRAPHQL_URL''] for WebSocket and GraphQL client initialization.\n\nThese env vars were not defined in DefinePlugin, causing \"process is not defined\"\nruntime errors in production builds where process.env is not available.\n\nFix: Added NX_WS_URL and NX_GRAPHQL_URL to DefinePlugin in all 4 MFE rspack configs.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuQ3gCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnS8QAGO8Xn6ozWvzGLMEig+sZb+V\norjV7mUvE3C8BvM5pldC0h/znYSv+MxDSoBovt74IpjS6L+ZBnG3x8cyf+u44lUU\nN90oDAfdx8KW19gz/l5S10w2XAYt4E9IE82TDcSjFqIf66Hue1AcGu0jfsGz0/7W\nMqDhLPTALFhbYDfK/8wavV4IyzLl4Hc2VzulJtLvqsUg4qyZzGXIVEakbfxfQbJy\ncIWb6Et+QsegZH0JGg8oHqOAJtVPVGiWTaOjSYowO3jgwjK+JNuPlNV/9jZG42Ib\npFyWFkRES9l1STg+UUo5zD8KSkR+hQCgLAW93DMte0QSFGWxfPBJZLJQW7eager9\nJwzjP5K7hsYISQ708rrfYHiO7pYTASPdY2FjnxcY6vx6Yyak6Q9IHE2pH1WV43Qj\nFRD8EVoQYu8sAuDf43zZxB9lZUl7GHNTXndi+Dv4TG/P1jzsa2QJ2Nl7psgEb/gb\nYoUg3EjXrQgNHrL1K5pywPmkO9laWx/tXngeEOGRXLRm3z3nB6NR1johP1PU3CI8\nEZx8tbw+oNxea6NZTHYRv0KwEJAHLxyqk817EFDiXYrhSW6KjLBpS81xfFrLeSgw\ndF6Ab1KK7l+ZrRGI0ytD4Fp+mXHFfh5ilid3BJ9Y0b5JsmFYXjok6cZm5CN9zNg5\nblD109Zc1evW7QQIzWMg\n=E0+M\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-17T08:16:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api