ts-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/5f29a5d6fad9208e39acb72e2f0dff481a4773ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T06:41:23Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T06:41:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(vercel): add --prod=false to install and remove NODE_ENV env var (#120)\n\nWhen NODE_ENV=production is set (Vercel sets this automatically),\npnpm install skips devDependencies. Since nx is a devDependency,\nthe build fails with \"not found: nx\".\n\nFix:\n1. Add --prod=false to Install Command to force devDeps installation\n2. Remove NODE_ENV=production from env vars (Vercel sets it automatically)\n3. Add troubleshooting entry for this error\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"16105f2331cd4e14ee182ea2fb80f1255ef5fde6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/16105f2331cd4e14ee182ea2fb80f1255ef5fde6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/5f29a5d6fad9208e39acb72e2f0dff481a4773ae","verification":{"payload":"tree 16105f2331cd4e14ee182ea2fb80f1255ef5fde6\nparent ffed92c951660739fe37087d2f49450bcec578b5\nauthor Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl <pateatlau@gmail.com> 1773729683 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773729683 +0530\n\nfix(vercel): add --prod=false to install and remove NODE_ENV env var (#120)\n\nWhen NODE_ENV=production is set (Vercel sets this automatically),\npnpm install skips devDependencies. Since nx is a devDependency,\nthe build fails with \"not found: nx\".\n\nFix:\n1. Add --prod=false to Install Command to force devDeps installation\n2. Remove NODE_ENV=production from env vars (Vercel sets it automatically)\n3. Add troubleshooting entry for this error\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signatu