roservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commit/d42d235d64a6e4a2637c13997ce7fa72dfb5acc8","sha":"d42d235d64a6e4a2637c13997ce7fa72dfb5acc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/d42d235d64a6e4a2637c13997ce7fa72dfb5acc8"}],"sha":"ffed92c951660739fe37087d2f49450bcec578b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/ffed92c951660739fe37087d2f49450bcec578b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/d42d235d64a6e4a2637c13997ce7fa72dfb5acc8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T05:59:12Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T05:59:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(vercel): comprehensive fix for Prisma and Nx wrapper build failures (#118)\n\nTwo issues were causing Vercel builds to fail:\n\n1. Prisma postinstall: pnpm install triggers @prisma/client postinstall\n   which looks for a schema file that doesn''t exist in frontend apps.\n   Previous fix (--ignore-scripts flag) was insufficient because Vercel\n   runs its own install step before the build command.\n\n2. Nx wrapper failure: The ./nx script calls .nx/nxw.js which internally\n   runs `npm i` to install Nx. With --ignore-scripts, this installation\n   is incomplete, causing \"Cannot find module\" error.\n\nComprehensive fix:\n- Do NOT set Root Directory in Vercel (run from repo root)\n- Do NOT set Install Command (let build command handle it)\n- Use `pnpm exec nx` instead of `pnpm nx` (bypasses .nx/nxw.js wrapper,\n  runs directly from node_modules/.bin/nx)\n- Build command: `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile --ignore-scripts &&\n  pnpm exec nx build <app> --configuration=production`\n- Output directory: `dist/apps/<app>` (no ../../ prefix needed)\n\nUpdated both deployment guides with corrected Vercel configuration.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6fb0fd4fe65cbc20fe200c2638122994f6eece56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/6fb0fd4fe65cbc20fe200c2638122994f6eece56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/d42d235d64a6e4a2637c13997ce7fa72dfb5acc8","verification":{"payload":"tree 6fb0fd4fe65cbc20fe200c2638122994f6eece56\nparent 0e1269ac2f0ec21f8903218d0e5a0b87f756f1d2\nauthor Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl <pateatlau@gmail.com> 1773727152 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773727152 +0530\n\nfix(vercel): comprehensive fix for Prisma and Nx wrapper build failures (#118)\n\nTwo issues were causing Vercel builds to fail:\n\n1. Prisma postinstall: pnpm install triggers @prisma/client postinstall\n   which looks for a schema file that doesn''t exist in frontend apps.\n   Previous fix (--ignore-scripts flag) was insufficient because Vercel\n   runs its own install step before the build command.\n\n2. Nx wrapper failure: The ./nx script calls .nx/nxw.js which internally\n   runs `npm i` to install Nx. With --ignore-scripts, this installation\n   is incomplete, causing \"Cannot find module\" error.\n\nComprehensive fix:\n- Do NOT set Root Directory in Vercel (run from repo root)\n- Do NOT set Install Command (let build command handle it)\n- Use `pnpm exec nx` instead of `pnpm nx` (bypasses .nx/nxw.js wrapper,\n  runs directly from node_modules/.bin/nx)\n- Build command: `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile --ignore-scripts &&\n  pnpm exec nx build <app> --configuration=production`\n- Output directory: `dist/apps/<app>` (no ../../ prefix needed)\n\nUpdated both deployment guides with corrected Vercel configuration.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuO2wCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADOIQAKKOq7VrzB6zArMSKaDKbtA4\nW7/4bpehQonrKkplgflfpCOeseOesWPTUbPD3OMCWZFEpJyJw9SyQTIuCD7kZ0Sz\n182vQhb70Gu/+eG3VMfBLK8oDlu6s2flhC9w0IrJgJBQKlFcPR/q0+PkYQFOLghz\nH4yyadPG6tcBsAGRTVszTA+WURk6TEqS0CkQ1wn/ZkebfchzYHW6LeBvgqP2uWND\ntWA2wxd+xw9n/zb6jJEJgWsrrN2Lv7pvS5T7mlWmR1kv/7ZeZCRbvI0SiO3kiyG3\nIlQ4XLWWZphkI96Lju2hPCdMmueY0KAUg8XCDZTn1O5dt4liaiit+Eiy2ZhLd3wk\nkWT4JamwQezmw2ZuENbI1bKkAOQjEDZhTmSL1/At5Y67EP148GSr/6HY9WwHR9JZ\nI0FS35yRye2aHJInzbUMTrrKb0rOTg6Za7CrxJ6rP/Q1hbUpSvlD4RQXgRiGsOcd\n/9sZt+mC59NDR5Ou75o7F/f3MnqLwSCbmW86hWgAWWTUqRYF+WRu109NYg5KgmX4\na8/fK8q3yAmrPyqTHa8pBp9YGc+lv3TJU5sD/dPS1FIVim2qI/Zyx+QkYs75AACE\nryHWgqSvKox6E6fHI3II5MBeVG/M0UW1oPDGuMQGD6/DtVmXR+E1yY1nxHoewxyP\n3+5Wv1USmcKNpJ0P7j7h\n=nSHP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-17T05:59:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commit/d42d235d64a6e4a2637c13997ce7fa72dfb5acc8","node_id":"C_kwDOQjNucdoAKGQ0MmQyMzVkNjRhNmU0YTI2MzdjMTM5OTdjZTdmYTcyZGZiNWFjYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commit/0e1269ac2f0ec21f8903218d0e5a0b87f756f1d2","sha":"0e1269ac2f0ec21f8903218d0e5a0b87f756f1d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/0e1269ac2f0ec21f8903218d0e5a0b87f756f1d2"}],"sha":"d42d235d64a6e4a2637c13997ce7fa72dfb5acc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/d42d235d64a6e4a2637c13997ce7fa72dfb5acc8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/0e1269ac2f0ec21f8903218d0e5a0b87f756f1d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T05:26:18Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T05:26:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(vercel): add .npmrc to frontend apps to prevent Prisma postinstall (#117)\n\nISSUE: Vercel builds failing with Prisma postinstall error even with --ignore-scripts flag\nROOT CAUSE: Vercel may run pnpm install separately before executing build command\nSOLUTION: Add .npmrc with ignore-scripts=true to each frontend app directory\n\nThis ensures postinstall scripts are disabled at the package level, not just via CLI flag.\n\nAffected apps:\n- apps/auth-mfe/.npmrc\n- apps/payments-mfe/.npmrc\n- apps/admin-mfe/.npmrc\n- apps/profile-mfe/.npmrc\n- apps/shell/.npmrc\n\nAlso added continuation prompt for Phase 3 Vercel deployment.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a417a170bf454db1097bd8b0f5b652f8a99b6ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/4a417a170bf454db1097bd8b0f5b652f8a99b6ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/0e1269ac2f0ec21f8903218d0e5a0b87f756f1d2","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a417a170bf454db1097bd8b0f5b652f8a99b6ea\nparent 2cc288b46bf728bdd2ac7a4b773a858915d578d4\nauthor Laldinglian