vents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/2cc288b46bf728bdd2ac7a4b773a858915d578d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T04:43:28Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T04:43:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix/railway service package manager (#116)\n\n* docs(railway): update docs for completed backend deployment\n\nAll 5 backend services successfully deployed to Railway:\n- Auth Service ✅\n- Payments Service ✅\n- Admin Service ✅\n- Profile Service ✅\n- API Gateway ✅\n\nUpdates:\n- README.md: Updated version to 0.4.1, marked backend as deployed\n- CD-POC-RAILWAY-VERCEL.md: Marked Phase 2 complete (100%)\n- CICD.md: Updated CD status to \"In Progress\" with backend complete\n- RAILWAY-BACKEND-DEPLOYMENT-GUIDE.md: All services marked complete\n\nAuto-deploy configured for all services.\nPhase 3 (Vercel frontend deployment) ready to start.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(railway): fix health endpoint paths in deployment guide\n\nUpdate health check endpoint documentation to match actual implementation:\n- /health → basic health check (unchanged)\n- /ready → /health/ready (readiness probe)\n- /live → /health/live (liveness probe)\n- Added /health/circuits for circuit breaker monitoring\n\nUpdated expected response format to match actual API Gateway response structure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(vercel): add --ignore-scripts flag to prevent Prisma postinstall errors\n\nFrontend builds don''t need Prisma (backend-only dependency). The postinstall\nscript was failing because it couldn''t find a schema file.\n\nSolution: Add --ignore-scripts to pnpm install in build commands.\n\nUpdated build commands for all 5 frontend apps:\n- auth-mfe\n- payments-mfe\n- admin-mfe\n- profile-mfe\n- shell\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* security(docs): remove leaked CloudAMQP credentials from deployment guide\n\nCRITICAL SECURITY FIX:\n- Removed exposed RabbitMQ credentials (amqps://ucavhcaz:...)\n- Replaced with placeholder text in all 5 occurrences\n- Added security warning about never committing credentials\n- Deleted log files containing leaked credentials\n\nADDITIONAL FIXES:\n- Fixed malformed JSON in health response example\n- Added missing closing braces and proper indentation\n\nAction Required:\n- CloudAMQP credentials must be rotated immediately\n- Update Railway environment variables with new credentials\n\nAddresses CodeRabbit security review feedback on PR #116\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"456e0642a95384d0808ea967ce750e9493c835b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/456e0642a95384d0808ea967ce750e9493c835b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/2cc288b46bf728bdd2ac7a4b773a858915d578d4","verification":{"payload":"tree 456e0642a95384d0808ea967ce750e9493c835b6\nparent 2205b4cc38bb36c408ef7b8e5fe9f07071814572\nauthor Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl <pateatlau@gmail.com> 1773722608 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773722608 +0530\n\nFix/railway service package manager (#116)\n\n* docs(railway): update docs for completed backend deployment\n\nAll 5 backend services successfully deployed to Railway:\n- Auth Service ✅\n- Payments Service ✅\n- Admin Service ✅\n- Profile Service ✅\n- API Gateway ✅\n\nUpdates:\n- README.md: Updated version to 0.4.1, marked backend as deployed\n- CD-POC-RAILWAY-VERCEL.md: Marked Phase 2 complete (100%)\n- CICD.md: Updated CD status to \"In Progress\" with backend complete\n- RAILWAY-BACKEND-DEPLOYMENT-GUIDE.md: All services marked complete\n\nAuto-deploy configured for all services.\nPhase 3 (Vercel frontend deployment) ready to start.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(railway): fix health endpoint paths in deployment guide\n\nUpdate health check endpoint documentation to match actual implementation:\n- /health → basic health check (unchanged)\n- /ready → /health/ready (readiness probe)\n- /live → /health/live (liveness probe)\n- Added /health/circuits for circuit breaker monitoring\n\nUpdated expected response format to match actual API Gateway response structure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(vercel): add --ignore-scripts flag to prevent Prisma postinstall errors\n\nFrontend builds don''t need Prisma (backend-only dependency). The postinstall\nscript was failing because it couldn''t find a schema file.\n\nSolution: Add --ignore-scripts to pnpm install in build commands.\n\nUpdated build commands for all 5 frontend apps:\n- auth-mfe\n- payments-mfe\n- admin-mfe\n- profile-mfe\n- shell\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* security(docs): remove leaked CloudAMQP credentials from deployment guide\n\nCRITICAL SECURITY FIX:\n- Removed exposed RabbitMQ credentials (amqps://ucavhcaz:...)\n- Replaced with placeholder text in all 5 occurrences\n- Added security warning about never committing credentials\n- Deleted log files containing leaked credentials\n\nADDITIONAL FIXES:\n- Fixed malformed JSON in health response example\n- Added missing closing braces and proper indentation\n\nAction Required:\n- CloudAMQP credentials must be rotated immediately\n- Update Railway environment variables with new credentials\n\nAddresses CodeRabbit security review feedback on PR #116\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuNvwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJeUQAGisoSV2GNtpzDENw80RKp34\ngZ4/Yco5BNQikCvSk/lzGsJhE9FDBsF5fxZc6+PKoEgKO2ID3W13XdCWMcXm63Lg\nZjKdxZzv3zrUvEVO3/6hoTNLgk64V2d9LnxvGDrW51htV85SmkjSWWUnPjlMu8dC\nvGOvOmJ/iaRQrGBzhnmuBaT6hmg62L0VFTZSbj0KA1qf34tANxsEJ8jhXxgbx3i4\nbiD0988W6GHTxFFy2ZHU9YosaleorDgsKOZTuJEupBnlI6ZLomjBYHT2siKQkeUz\nHt17FIge0JZOkTMsBhRHzEZUcNS9yO6lcQXmHuj9FKYMrCrsmkchzPryJvYUNs5g\n3+SRoVCWh4ddNiyRRS5hooRmHSfX2H44DyNbFprM3BhBHA9MBj4auFdx9vqOpqpF\nVH/CuxEOELt3WfTXBuGSavCv+sSgV3uvJAFlAgRMrKJE/7gNvOksJeRodjyneq+y\n5qiQhnMz3e45wdxx02rLmuvhhkrA0HUq1Fi9Y3SBwCJqUVNdWR0edYBybBXSnyGI\nt1XFLkONCdqIzpB5CIw6hL7oc63J4TmJ7/LrA8C3AnCn9j4PINZcX2rQ/koKyO0N\n6vnsy/ZWE4ND02X5Ok6KdZIU/E6/pJxrOjxnvEvA4+HW4ruJ30zz0MmbljiXluFI\nkMv+eEaq9nqTB6OSdKEG\n=2oVl\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-17T04:43:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commit/2cc288b46bf728bdd2ac7a4b773a858915d578d4","node_id":"C_kwDOQjNucdoAKDJjYzI4OGI0NmJmNzI4YmRkMmFjN2E0Yjc3M2E4NTg5MTVkNTc4ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commit/2205b4cc38bb36c408ef7b8e5fe9f07071814572","sha":"2205b4cc38bb36c408ef7b8e5fe9f07071814572","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/2205b4cc38bb36c408ef7b8e5fe9f07071814572"}],"sha":"2cc288b46bf728bdd2ac7a4b773a858915d578d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/2cc288b46bf728bdd2ac7a4b773a858915d578d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/2205b4cc38bb36c408ef7b8e5fe9f07071814572/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T17:29:09Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T17:29:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(railway): comprehensive production deployment fixes (#115)\n\n* fix(railway): comprehensive production deployment fixes\n\n1. Config files now read DATABASE_URL with fallback to service-specific\n   names (AUTH_DATABASE_URL, etc.) for CI/local dev compatibility\n2. Build commands copy entire prisma/ dir (schema + migrations) to dist\n3. Deployment guide updated with ALL required env vars per service:\n   - auth-service: JWT_SECRET, JWT_REFRESH_SECRET, REDIS_URL, RABBITMQ_URL\n   - payments-service: REDIS_URL, RABBITMQ_URL, AUTH_SERVICE_URL\n   - admin-service: RABBITMQ_URL, AUTH_SERVICE_URL\n   - profile-service: REDIS_URL, JWT_SECRET, AUTH_SERVICE_URL\n   - api-gateway: JWT_SECRET, JWT_REFRESH_SECRET, REDIS_URL, CORS_ORIGINS, all SERVICE_URLs\n4. Build commands use cp -r for prisma dir (includes migrations)\n\nRoot cause of latest crash: JWT_REFRESH_SECRET env var was not set,\nand config-helper.ts throws in production when JWT secrets are missing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(railway): address CodeRabbit security review findings\n\n1. Prisma buildDatabaseUrl() now reads DATABASE_URL first (matches config)\n   - All 4 services (auth, payments, admin, profile) updated\n   - Resolution order: DATABASE_URL → SERVICE_DATABASE_URL → localhost default\n\n2. Remove hardcoded JWT secrets from deployment guide\n   - Replaced with placeholders: <your-generated-jwt-secret-from-step-above>\n   - Added clear generation instructions using openssl rand -hex 64\n   - Emphasized never committing/reusing example secrets\n\nFixes security concerns raised in PR #115 review.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45d6b2f1d335fb5a715131e369d5697b442722a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/45d6b2f1d335fb5a715131e369d5697b442722a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/2205b4cc38bb36c408ef7b8e5fe9f07071814572","verification":{"payload":"tree 45d6b2f1d335fb5a715131e369d5697b442722a5\nparent 9319b1f669c4716067709cabfa56662afdea06d0\nauthor Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl <pateatlau@gmail.com> 1773682149 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773682149 +0530\n\nfix(railway): comprehensive production deployment fixes (#115)\n\n* fix(railway): comprehensive production deployment fixes\n\n1. Config files now read DATABASE_URL with fallback to service-specific\n   names (AUTH_DATABASE_URL, etc.) for CI/local dev compatibility\n2. Build commands copy entire prisma/ dir (schema + migrations) to dist\n3. Deployment guide updated with ALL required env vars per service:\n   - auth-service: JWT_SECRET, JWT_REFRESH_SECRET, REDIS_URL, RABBITMQ_URL\n   - payments-service: REDIS_URL, RABBITMQ_URL, AUTH_SERVICE_URL\n   - admin-service: RABBITMQ_URL, AUTH_SERVICE_URL\n   - profile-service: REDIS_URL, JWT_SECRET, AUTH_SERVICE_URL\n   - api-gateway: JWT_SECRET, JWT_REFRESH_SECRET, REDIS_URL, CORS_ORIGINS, all SERVICE_URLs\n4. Build commands use cp -r for prisma dir (includes migrations)\n\nRoot cause of latest crash: JWT_REFRESH_SECRET env var was not set,\nand config-helper.ts throws in production when JWT secrets are missing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(railway): address CodeRabbit security review findings\n\n1. Prisma buildDatabaseUrl() now reads DATABASE_URL first (matches config)\n   - All 4 services (auth, payments, admin, profile) updated\n   - Resolution order: DATABASE_URL → SERVICE_DATABASE_URL → localhost default\n\n2. Remove hardcoded JWT secrets from deployment guide\n   - Replaced with placeholders: <your-generated-jwt-secret-from-step-above>\n   - Added clear generation instructions using openssl rand -hex 64\n   - Emphasized never committing/reusing example secrets\n\nFixes security concerns raised in PR #115 review.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuD3lCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlX0QAGQMaXcMwptyFib2AXZuYv/1\n6SQJfB/suHix1oeheiG4kYI8YZwXiBUH/p/w1qhUEYZldcHA9Wfbo+e2f8JrAeUW\nsdnPT0+UfwJjToRWBaq4UOEDL3ip0vs6Vj4Tt7BHitlXWGxNnrcjaSWg1bytecwM\naxlnGFRqfz0SrZeoWXLfG35xvNfg7LzeVCf8Il2IgCPcvUJnp0eBXP523WB7GhLo\nuyEpT9LSQ3nEealzS0DUEfR7E3LGocG6ShYVxpYGgwYTNzSjrLc+HToaW5U1cmhR\naUTP8CJIcAlWfOiLE1NkE4Evflm1soWxJiJJD93V44ZDXK4rRNvwiT78MC7s8CEG\nISG7Sb5zhqJXMmUa/74KxGgGyeuW5phJGnqo2cfLhrMC6VtOQwRdFqavSt5r4Y4e\nc1cpu67+COAlaElV0ZGUvB5qSUjkjAI+EOHirpvVZcVfKmlhJsi0/MxsI0+YyL7j\ng8H6k44Yxr5j6O2WAYaPLWT6fSO7caY4FixJx+A2CiB152Uz25h/vrkdRInlH6dj\n840jGDiic85wuKA9RosM7DO72ua/sREFVhuPK8vL0wqVj0Zc8lJ+qxzlxdPLUytM\nzSHUuCEY3lxIDhxgMDJC8vKo4TPrLzyDz+TyBgpzrJ1cgbXKJ3/k8bjBym1kvndt\nvY5K1beRucVI9cIV0F91\n=uq5I\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-16T17:29:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/u