omments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T17:01:40Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T17:01:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(railway): fix build/start commands for unbundled esbuild (#114)\n\n- Remove Root Directory requirement (must build from repo root)\n- Add production deps installation in dist directory\n- Add Prisma client generation in dist directory\n- Add empty pnpm-workspace.yaml to prevent workspace resolution\n- Update all 5 service configurations (auth, payments, admin, profile, api-gateway)\n- Add comprehensive troubleshooting for runtime module resolution issues\n- Document Nx esbuild bundle:false architecture requirements\n\nRoot cause: Nx esbuild with bundle:false doesn''t bundle npm packages.\nNode.js resolves modules from file location (dist/apps/<service>/), not\nrepo root''s node_modules. Solution: install deps + generate Prisma in\ndist directory, run from dist directory.\n\nTested locally with auth-service - confirmed service starts successfully.","tree":{"sha":"7c5fc8221a7df6f513a4488c8b8a035a1f7e87c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/7c5fc8221a7df6f513a4488c8b8a035a1f7e87c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/9319b1f669c4716067709cabfa56662afdea06d0","verification":{"payload":"tree 7c5fc8221a7df6f513a4488c8b8a035a1f7e87c7\nparent aebf06b6f8d24be51fc7d2dde476a6efdc881659\nauthor Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl <pateatlau@gmail.com> 1773680500 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773680500 +0530\n\ndocs(railway): fix build/start commands for unbundled esbuild (#114)\n\n- Remove Root Directory requirement (must build from repo root)\n- Add production deps installation in dist directory\n- Add Prisma client generation in dist directory\n- Add empty pnpm-workspace.yaml to pr