lau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/4982ceb7e43963217b8b1e694e9d18c183f4e21c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T10:19:28Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T10:19:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(railway): add packageManager field for Railpack detection (#111)\n\n* fix(railway): add packageManager field for Railpack detection\n\nRailway switched from Nixpacks to Railpack which requires\npackageManager field in package.json to detect pnpm.\n\n- Added \"packageManager\": \"pnpm@9.15.4\" to package.json\n- This ensures Railway uses pnpm instead of defaulting to npm\n- Fixes: pnpm: not found error in Railway deployments\n\n* fix(ci): remove pnpm version from workflow to use packageManager field\n\nThe pnpm/action-setup@v4 action doesn''t allow specifying version\nin both the workflow and package.json packageManager field.\n\nChanges:\n- Removed ''version'' from all pnpm/action-setup steps\n- Removed PNPM_VERSION env var\n- pnpm version now read from package.json packageManager field\n- Fixes: Multiple versions of pnpm specified 