or ease of use and automatic hosting.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(cd): apply final minor refinements for precision and clarity\n\nApplied 4 final polish items from architect review:\n\n1. Clarified MFE manifest hosting path - explicit note that manifest\n   is served at /mfe-manifest.json via Vercel static hosting\n\n2. Added cache-control rule for mfe-manifest.json - ensures instant\n   rollback capability by preventing stale manifest caching\n\n3. Added REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS and RETRY_ATTEMPTS to env reference table\n   for documentation consistency\n\n4. Softened ''No Sleep Delays'' claim to ''Minimal Sleep - Configured to\n   avoid sleep delays for demo workloads'' for technical accuracy\n\nItem 5 (Nx parallel builds) noted as future optimization - not required\nfor current POC deployment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review comments for CD docs and pentest script\n\nPR Comment 1 - manual-pentest.sh:\n- Add TESTS_STARTED flag to track when tests actually run\n- Modify cleanup_and_summary to only print summary when TESTS_STARTED=true\n- Prevents spurious summary output for --help or unknown options\n\nPR Comment 2 - CD-POC-RAILWAY-VERCEL.md:\n- Add safer database rollback workflow with pre-check steps\n- Include prisma migrate status/diff commands before reset\n- Add interactive reset option (without --force) as recommended\n- Add pre-reset checklist to verify POC environment and data loss acceptance\n\nPR Comment 3 - CD-POC-RAILWAY-VERCEL.md:\n- Change RABBITMQ_URL from ''<cloudamqp-url-or-empty>'' to ''<your-cloudamqp-url>''\n- Add note clarifying RABBITMQ_URL is required with Phase 2.3 cross-reference\n\nPR Comment 4 - CD-POC-RAILWAY-VERCEL.md:\n- Fix grammar: ''Logout from customer'' -> ''Log out from customer account''\n- Use correct verb form (two words) instead of noun form\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(cd): fix linting and formatting issues in deployment plan\n\nPR review fixes:\n\n1. Blockquote formatting: Remove blank line between Timeout/Retry Policy\n   and Contract Validation blockquotes to form contiguous block\n\n2. Hyphenation: Change ''Rate Limiting'' to ''Rate-Limiting'' in section\n   headers (compound adjective modifier)\n\n3. Spelling: Change ''netbanking'' to ''net banking'' for clarity\n\n4. Missing env var: Add RABBITMQ_URL to API Gateway environment\n   variables block (Phase 2.4) with cross-reference note\n\n5. Markdown lint MD040: Add language identifiers to all fenced code\n   blocks - ''text'' for ASCII diagrams and scripts, ''bash'' for env vars\n   and shell commands, ''json'' for JSON, ''typescript'' for TS code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpjwfXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/lIQAF+dSPEb5WkACWL28mtmcR69\nwaFyBLG9i17qtkg7fdvQ4DinBcfjAmm5UeBXswRFPlfKcV54MSIIinN3mURaXSd4\nlkjKjW1vdilaAaWElzJKegwsuHL3xlhosnVoqT1jOqFIje9WmNpZ/z+AKkDRhdyp\n2suruzm38SGIfdB/E7ssB3gBm0DIsSpvvZnMXowRqA83l88ksSpgRls7WptlI0LY\nf/BZSdY7VdsUUC6n4uLSkH+GQ5JBjkmdCRNtQlTD5qkB+m+TZDa8Un5u1bnWft+P\nRMPWd1UYGMTE8MVYUid96yxYOUESPBQjAm7Arp6EtTWg7mnb/9nOhNoDPn9g5Ryx\ncQZjgdOSbHR4OCLeIvmL4+N3VEKyqqMAwQHP97JEAMW8wP7FoiLYX1YU3Uj0AN8Z\n06Jl8f6LAqTDk94BN42gCMnyyRhoxbPxZjVdgeUixh0fSoIVlc5PD9wgyRU7Hc2K\nqyDlJf+8opvzjY33Bf2b+zJFs7mPVuTZYvBdQfTtbL9vOfz44D9wHFzGNQXMF9VK\nNypI79ybL5V07Ott/ckZU/Dx5KvGL2BIN8cRu1Xgkw6gBtHWKn7SZAfQRvsMKPT6\nBe6MMkLLppF/BkYyUTKE3H7kqedyPX5fMDbn5MWLGZPeBQUbLaD2H6JssrBUtCKv\n+4K3Svc8W32IEpIPs5G6\n=tur2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-13T11:15:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commit/2b3ae4bb10edbba453892e451d346e9884e2dd86","node_id":"C_kwDOQjNucdoAKDJiM2FlNGJiMTBlZGJiYTQ1Mzg5MmU0NTFkMzQ2ZTk4ODRlMmRkODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commit/8fa308f8ad15954e3d024589902c713225756825","sha":"8fa308f8ad15954e3d024589902c713225756825","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/8fa308f8ad15954e3d024589902c713225756825"}],"sha":"2b3ae4bb10edbba453892e451d346e9884e2dd86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/2b3ae4bb10edbba453892e451d346e9884e2dd86"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/8fa308f8ad15954e3d024589902c713225756825/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-13T04:55:28Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-13T04:55:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(security): add comprehensive manual penetration testing script (#83)\n\nAdd manual-pentest.sh with the following test categories:\n- Auth bypass attempts (JWT tampering, SQL/NoSQL injection, email enumeration)\n- XSS injection attempts (query params, stored XSS, Content-Type checks)\n- CSRF attack simulation (cross-origin, SameSite cookies, forged Referer)\n- Rate limit bypass attempts (X-Forwarded-For, User-Agent rotation)\n- Session hijacking attempts (token reuse, fingerprint mismatch, fixation)\n- Module Federation tampering (path traversal, CSP, source maps, CORS)\n\nUsage:\n  pnpm security:pentest           # Run all tests\n  pnpm security:pentest:auth      # Auth bypass tests only\n  pnpm security:pentest:xss       # XSS tests only\n  pnpm security:pentest:csrf      # CSRF tests only\n  pnpm security:pentest:rate-limit # Rate limit tests only\n  pnpm security:pentest:session   # Session hijacking tests only\n  pnpm security:pentest:mfe       # Module Federation tests only\n\nAlso adds security-reports/ to .gitignore (generated by ZAP scans)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6191100cdbda17c93c49979562357ab465279b48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/6191100cdbda17c93c49979562357ab465279b48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/8fa308f8ad15954e3d024589902c713225756825","verification":{"payload":"tree 6191100cdbda17c93c49979562357ab465279b48\nparent 080b6427144b041dedcb0676cef3d0085c18c96f\nauthor Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl <pateatlau@gmail.com> 1770958528 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770958528 +0530\n\nfeat(security): add comprehensive manual penetration testing script (#83)\n\nAdd manual-pentest.sh with the following test categories:\n- Auth bypass attempts (JWT tampering, SQL/NoSQL injection, email enumeration)\n- XSS injection attempts (query params, stored XSS, Content-Type checks)\n- CSRF attack simulation (cross-origin, SameSite cookies, forged Referer)\n- Rate limit bypass attempts (X-Forwarded-For, User-Agent rotation)\n- Session hijacking attempts (token reuse, fingerprint mismatch, fixation)\n- Module Federation tampering (path traversal, CSP, source maps, CORS)\n\nUsage:\n  pnpm security:pentest           # Run all tests\n  pnpm security:pentest:auth      # Auth bypass tests only\n  pnpm security:pentest:xss       # XSS tests only\n  pnpm security:pentest:csrf      # CSRF tests only\n  pnpm security:pentest:rate-limit # Rate limit tests only\n  pnpm security:pentest:session   # Session hijacking tests only\n  pnpm security:pentest:mfe       # Module Federation tests only\n\nAlso adds security-reports/ to .gitignore (generated by ZAP scans)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpjq7ACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAi9QQAGqCqAiGNF0II2WSBn9S/73T\nuv7SZPwDeXqk0QtT6r5c9hWYfjr59CMYqpikijN+lkPsgx9VtUUHN+NyjzhFZz7e\nL81eIBS3WdM6Xi3I+Igf3hFRlr63QH9Q74lRPTPKhmxqpwfg6bRV44Xh1/uvK9De\nJJqv8leGEB+eBz7QqXBcv1Kq0g7eHZsqJQdyS