.com/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commit/ec1d93ec6f875ec10e164a768235c3138f5ca2a9","sha":"ec1d93ec6f875ec10e164a768235c3138f5ca2a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/ec1d93ec6f875ec10e164a768235c3138f5ca2a9"}],"sha":"8bb85b0647efdeaefd854cd6efe65dec0da2ab4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/8bb85b0647efdeaefd854cd6efe65dec0da2ab4e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/ec1d93ec6f875ec10e164a768235c3138f5ca2a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-12T07:13:52Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-12T07:13:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(security): Phase 5 - XSS & Injection Prevention (#80)\n\n* feat(security): Phase 5 Tasks 5.1-5.4 - XSS & Injection Prevention\n\nImplemented XSS and injection prevention measures:\n\nTask 5.1 - Audit dangerouslySetInnerHTML:\n- No usage found in application code (already secure)\n- Only innerHTML in test fixtures (acceptable)\n\nTask 5.2 - Install and Configure DOMPurify:\n- Added dompurify, isomorphic-dompurify packages\n- Created sanitize.ts utility with multiple presets (strict, standard, rich, textOnly)\n- Added sanitizeHtml, stripHtml, containsDangerousHtml, sanitizeUrl functions\n- 46 tests for XSS attack vectors\n\nTask 5.3 - Replace Unsafe HTML Usage:\n- No replacements needed (codebase already secure)\n\nTask 5.4 - Add Event Bus Validation:\n- Created Zod schemas for all 15 event types\n- Added validation to EventBus emit function\n- Configurable via enableValidation and strictValidation options\n- 22 validation tests\n\nFiles added:\n- libs/shared-utils/src/lib/sanitize.ts\n- libs/shared-utils/src/lib/sanitize.spec.ts\n- libs/shared-event-bus/src/lib/schemas.ts\n- libs/shared-event-bus/src/lib/schemas.spec.ts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(security): Phase 5 Tasks 5.5-5.6 - API Sanitization & ESLint Security Rules\n\nTask 5.5 - API Response Sanitization:\n- Audited all backend services for HTML content in responses\n- Backend already has comprehensive sanitizeString() in all validators\n- No additional middleware needed (already secure)\n\nTask 5.6 - ESLint Security Rules:\n- Installed eslint-plugin-security@^3.0.1\n- Installed eslint-plugin-react for react/no-danger rule\n- Added 13 security rules:\n  - detect-unsafe-regex, detect-eval-with-expression\n  - detect-no-csrf-before-method-override, detect-bidi-characters\n  - detect-object-injection, detect-non-literal-fs-filename\n  - detect-non-literal-regexp, detect-non-literal-require\n  - detect-possible-timing-attacks, detect-pseudoRandomBytes\n  - detect-buffer-noassert, detect-child-process\n  - detect-disable-mustache-escape\n- Added react/no-danger rule to warn on dangerouslySetInnerHTML\n- All 38 projects pass lint with 0 errors\n\nPhase 5 Complete: 100% (6/6 tasks)\nOverall Progress: 71% (30/42 tasks, 5/7 phases)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shared-utils): fix DOMPurify TypeScript types for production build\n\n- Use namespace import with ESM/CommonJS fallback handling\n- Lazy-initialize DOMPurify to ensure window is available in tests\n- Use proper DOMPurify type import (DOMPurify vs DOMPurifyI)\n- Add explicit Element type for addHook callback parameter\n\nThis fixes the CI build failure where TypeScript couldn''t find\nDOMPurify methods like addHook, removeHook, and sanitize.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review comments for Phase 5 XSS prevention\n\nDocument updates:\n- Fix summary table: Phase 5 now 6/6 (100%), total 30/42 (71%)\n- Update status to \"Phases 1-5 complete, starting Phase 6\"\n\nEventBus security improvements:\n- Remove sensitive payload data from validation warning logs\n- Reject invalid events in non-strict mode (return early)\n- Fix system:error test payload to match schema structure\n\nSanitize.ts security hardening:\n- Use permanent DOMPurify hook (thread-safe, no add/remove per call)\n- Use separate DOMPurify instances to avoid hook interference\n- Fix containsDangerousHtml to use strict equality comparison\n- Fix sanitizeUrl to handle protocol injection attacks\n  (normalizes control characters before protocol checks)\n- Return trimmed URL instead of original with whitespace\n- Support more relative URL patterns (../, ?, #)\n- Remove misleading FORCE_BODY comment\n\nDependency cleanup:\n- Remove unused isomorphic-dompurify dependency\n- Remove deprecated @types/dompurify (DOMPurify has bundled types)\n- Fix pnpm-lock.yaml: remove libs/dist/shared-ui phantom workspace\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shared-event-bus): use dot notation for process.env.NODE_ENV\n\nChange from bracket notation process.env[''NODE_ENV''] to dot notation\nprocess.env.NODE_ENV so Rspack/DefinePlugin can statically replace\nthe value at build time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shared-event-bus): revert to bracket notation and remove payload from dev logs\n\n- Revert process.env.NODE_ENV to process.env[''NODE_ENV''] for TypeScript\n  compatibility (noPropertyAccessFromIndexSignature)\n- Remove payload from development console.log to avoid exposing sensitive\n  data like accessToken, refreshToken, email\n- Now only logs eventType and meta in development mode\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9be6c5eaf82d94152d2dd52f83cf156f87256692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/9be6c5eaf82d94152d2dd52f83cf156f87256692"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/ec1d93ec6f875ec10e164a768235c3138f5ca2a9","verification":{"payload":"tree 9be6c5eaf82d94152d2dd52f83cf156f87256692\nparent 4629ae53db48c4ed9a792055b5d7070e4f2eefbb\nauthor Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl <pateatlau@gmail.com> 1770880432 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770880432 +0530\n\nfeat(security): Phase 5 - XSS & Injection Prevention (#80)\n\n* feat(security): Phase 5 Tasks 5.1-5.4 - XSS & Injection Prevention\n\nImplemented XSS and injection prevention measures:\n\nTask 5.1 - Audit dangerouslySetInnerHTML:\n- No usage found in application code (already secure)\n- Only innerHTML in test fixtures (acceptable)\n\nTask 5.2 - Install and Configure DOMPurify:\n- Added dompurify, isomorphic-dompurify packages\n- Created sanitize.ts utility with multiple presets (strict, standard, rich, textOnly)\n- Added sanitizeHtml, stripHtml, containsDangerousHtml, sanitizeUrl functions\n- 46 tests for XSS attack vectors\n\nTask 5.3 - Replace Unsafe HTML Usage:\n- No replacements needed (codebase already secure)\n\nTask 5.4 - Add Event Bus Validation:\n- Created Zod schemas for all 15 event types\n- Added validation to EventBus emit function\n- Configurable via enableValidation and strictValidation options\n- 22 validation tests\n\nFiles added:\n- libs/shared-utils/src/lib/sanitize.ts\n- libs/shared-utils/src/lib/sanitize.spec.ts\n- libs/shared-event-bus/src/lib/schemas.ts\n- libs/shared-event-bus/src/lib/schemas.spec.ts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(security): Phase 5 Tasks 5.5-5.6 - API Sanitization & ESLint Security Rules\n\nTask 5.5 - API Response Sanitization:\n- Audited all backend services for HTML content in responses\n- Backend already has comprehensive sanitizeString() in all validators\n- No additional middleware needed (already secure)\n\nTask 5.6 - ESLint Security Rules:\n- Installed eslint-plugin-security@^3.0.1\n- Installed eslint-plugin-react for react/no-danger rule\n- Added 13 security rules:\n  - detect-unsafe-regex, detect-eval-with-expression\n  - detect-no-csrf-before-method-override, detect-bidi-characters\n  - detect-object-injection, detect-non-literal-fs-filename\n  - detect-non-literal-regexp, detect-non-literal-require\n  - detect-possible-timing-attacks, detect-pseudoRandomBytes\n  - detect-buffer-noassert, detect-child-process\n  - detect-disable-mustache-escape\n- Added react/no-danger rule to warn on dangerouslySetInnerHTML\n- All 38 projects pass lint with 0 errors\n\nPhase 5 Complete: 100% (6/6 tasks)\nOverall Progress: 71% (30/42 tasks, 5/7 phases)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shared-utils): fix DOMPurify TypeScript types for production build\n\n- Use namespace import with ESM/CommonJS fallback handling\n- Lazy-initialize DOMPurify to ensure window is available in tests\n- Use proper DOMPurify type import (DOMPurify vs DOMPurifyI)\n- Add explicit Element type for addHook callback parameter\n\nThis fixes the CI build failure where TypeScript couldn''t find\nDOMPurify methods like addHook, removeHook, and sanitize.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address PR review comments for Phase 5 XSS prevention\n\nDocument updates:\n- Fix summary table: Phase 5 now 6/6 (100%), total 30/42 (71%)\n- Update status to \"Phases 1-5 complete, starting Phase 6\"\n\nEventBus security improvements:\n- Remove sensitive payload data from validation warning logs\n- Reject invalid events in non-strict mode (return early)\n- Fix system:error test payload to match schema structure\n\nSanitize.ts security hardening:\n- Use permanent DOMPurify hook (thread-safe, no add/remove per call)\n- Use separate DOMPurify instances to avoid hook interference\n- Fix containsDangerousHtml to use strict equality comparison\n- Fix sanitizeUrl to handle protocol injection attacks\n  (normalizes control characters before protocol checks)\n- Return trimmed URL instead of original with whitespace\n- Support more relative URL patterns (../, ?, #)\n- Remove misleading FORCE_BODY comment\n\nDependency cleanup:\n- Remove unused isomorphic-dompurify dependency\n- Remove deprecated @types/dompurify (DOMPurify has bundled types)\n- Fix pnpm-lock.yaml: remove libs/dist/shared-ui phantom workspace\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shared-event-bus): use dot notation for process.env.NODE_ENV\n\nChange from bracket notation process.env[''NODE_ENV''] to dot notation\nprocess.env.NODE_ENV so Rspack/DefinePlugin can statically replace\nthe value at build time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shared-event-bus): revert to bracket notation and remove payload from dev logs\n\n- Revert process.env.NODE_ENV to process.env[''NODE_ENV''] for TypeScript\n  compatibility (noPropertyAccessFromIndexSignature)\n- Remove payload from development console.log to avoid exposing sensitive\n  data like accessToken, refreshToken, email\n- Now only logs eventType and meta in development mode\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpjX2wCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAq84QACSAPa7bMLTWhGMXS7AeuMdQ\nQVHH6e4zmN0bn+yqmZvDKS/p3Z1M262RdlIVHHE/Lp8tRlMf1CLNXLF2kLIeff7h\nJeSuglivhFHpVMiUsV4V3mkFDyjet0I4UbsgcvPE3dU/JASTsMRVyaVoN3a5BW2R\nN/BfhYorWA7DX/CbZrU1mdVohkkgwjb90IuzSy10dMQ+yh6ikuirjn7qmKTwaL75\nuQwhZa0CzLCxbO+Hhw5ftefhknjGhqdtXxNc0qs4W3y6Rz4dmBx5WV3XDjPFR7fF\n16efzguJV89xnlUMUlyd/W4mQnZGa09S2t/Axx/tROCJMd/GYhntcnMoFjZd+xVF\nzOFYKYsX+V1/25AT5w62mM5zlDyK7CJHxOmgiQUT1d9U8kEmYMvSoJFPumKAXGpO\ntIsle2KZpSWd/xvrlh9NkPajcVGu6r3MvyhwOVcaJJH4hihPDE23NLBv3eb46EK6\n/lnomRwTFhGPrl0ztLP2bt596knVHolRCg5e2LqaJ8fzZnkRUTVTjDUESC5j3vG7\nV9RgzIvRSmqwtiwrROTFdpLbVtoHx0rhF2MeowJU5Q1tMDKSt0RFLuQCDlD5KMS4\naBdSvT8/MUEW74CmC+rPqVR6GS5KGDA+hJQzWRSJJ91gv7gbdVi2/RXNaCSvwDNT\nXgkVl2Pfv1NHZtvCshMt\n=HpG9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-12T07:13:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commit/ec1d93ec6f875ec10e164a768235c3138f5ca2a9","node_id":"C_kwDOQjNucdoAKGVjMWQ5M2VjNmY4NzVlYzEwZTE2NGE3NjgyMzVjMzEzOGY1Y2EyYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commit/4629ae53db48c4ed9a792055b5d7070e4f2eefbb","sha":"4629ae53db48c4ed9a792055b5d7070e4f2eefbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/4629ae53db48c4ed9a792055b5d7070e4f2eefbb"}],"sha":"ec1d93ec6f875ec10e164a768235c3138f5ca2a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/ec1d93ec6f875ec10e164a768235c3138f5ca2a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/4629ae53db48c4ed9a792055b5d7070e4f2eefbb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-11T21:46:20Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T21:46:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix/dependabot docker config (#79)\n\n* fix(ci): disable docker ecosystem in Dependabot config\n\nThe docker ecosystem requires Dockerfiles to analyze and update base image\nversions. This project uses docker-compose.yml with pre-built images\n(postgres, redis, nginx, etc.) but doesn''t have its own Dockerfiles.\n\nCommented out the docker config with explanation for future reference\nif Dockerfiles are added later.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ci): add security-scan to CI dependency chain\n\n- Add security-scan to e2e-tests needs array\n- Add security-scan to ci-status needs array\n- Include security-scan result in ci-status check\n\nThis ensures security vulnerabilities block E2E tests and\nfail the overall CI status check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"94cd5b12bc7ac08d68755fc5dcc485a1d0a5edfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/94cd5b12bc7ac08d68755fc5dcc485a1d0a5edfc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/4629ae53db48c4ed9a792055b5d7070e4f2eefbb","verification":{"payload":"tree 94cd5b12bc7ac08d68755fc5dcc485a1d0a5edfc\nparent ce414f1d6be2cde697de268f992c5f0d5c5fc817\nauthor Laldingliana Tlau Vantawl <pateatlau@gmail.com> 1770846380 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770846380 +0530\n\nFix/dependabot docker config (#79)\n\n* fix(ci): disable docker ecosystem in Dependabot config\n\nThe docker ecosystem requires Dockerfiles to analyze and update base image\nversions. This project uses docker-compose.yml with pre-built images\n(postgres, redis, nginx, etc.) but doesn''t have its own Dockerfiles.\n\nCommented out the docker config with explanation for future reference\nif Dockerfiles are added later.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ci): add security-scan to CI dependency chain\n\n- Add security-scan to e2e-tests needs array\n- Add security-scan to ci-status needs array\n- Include security-scan result in ci-status check\n\nThis ensures security vulnerabilities block E2E tests and\nfail the overall CI status check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpjPisCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASMIQAItzshBZssdzpeMnl4BlNCeT\nk1ZoXacZDTh7M+gTk5mmrP2scWOHSofhNV1HIF2noLv/DNo4hcauWC5MOkMydMv6\nahgKC2UQgM8Co0pRJMQ/XLzDGbkJQjSibraeaunAFUCg9FtJ1R0CdKa3dlqi2qUZ\njwHgmtn5SX9NxFqMvLWcAh7G6emXA3Q+Hc4ChgcQJEzK+u5+aqMwKbe00avM0sG6\nblNjszPztOTCTXUFrGE3rsjfzLoiHkCa7Yb6vI5X6K9NjOJI+uXFQeVXkfRiYzB9\nYwEHvLZIRJ2gqgtfL+l0Kgy3eET6FsS4Z9WCaRUmUxRusjAezL3bT8AeWwC0YIL9\nCjONg2818JIg2s2+8wsJcYxeTvmSJGxvdASxiuaxn8kkGzgE1l/ovPMMNaWYCXZC\nMCX20ZAGXHe1TWvc1u922kBN3TPz5GaQsQ4hFvCsCaRJ5GZSSUiNu46Kn3QqiIHr\nAK8D+n/ptelMosOKXk8r7AdQ8457BcywBNAqFlUoyox17s1HwjZtaAnwg8CBTMxC\nmXqTBOz0ezf58wOR8HYRs89UCoyDpt4ACNdwoU/ptWIFEO6i5HSNu+zMoa4H2r82\nG9cz0doZujPToOgrgWD2aMmx91JUUCVXTdwdhQRyyj05u6Y/Evr6H7pvUHgShv0R\nVVuRcxtbtwcgxaWyF2Zw\n=Mi2N\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-11T21:46:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://a