{"date":"2026-01-24T18:20:11Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"feat(a11y): add consistent red asterisk indicators to required form fields\n\nAdd visual indicators (red asterisks) to all required form fields for\nconsistency across the application. This improves accessibility by\nproviding clear visual cues for required fields (WCAG 3.3.2).\n\nForms updated:\n- SignIn: Email, Password\n- SignUp: Full Name, Email, Password, Confirm Password\n- ForgotPassword: Email\n- ResetPassword: New Password, Confirm Password\n- PaymentCreateForm: Amount, Currency, Payment Type, Description, Recipient\n\nTests updated to use regex patterns for label queries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2055913d83145f3a298997f0c5355d3056c4a051","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/2055913d83145f3a298997f0c5355d3056c4a051"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/362ab456fa91cf563aa1c87ce2d4051ad394a5d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","