its/9d4eb0ccac34da1a0dfd69b56d462c37ef0116fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-24T18:01:32Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-24T18:01:32Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"feat(a11y): add FormField component for accessible forms (Priority 1.5)\n\nAdd FormField wrapper component with proper ARIA associations for form\naccessibility, enabling WCAG 3.3.1 and 3.3.3 compliance.\n\nFeatures:\n- Automatic label-input association via htmlFor/id\n- Error messages linked via aria-describedby\n- Descriptions linked via aria-describedby\n- aria-invalid attribute on fields with errors\n- aria-required attribute on required fields\n- Error messages with role=\"alert\" and aria-live=\"polite\"\n- useFormField hook for custom input components\n- Support for hidden labels while maintaining accessibility\n\nIncludes 20 unit tests covering all accessibility scenarios.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23b429ade6e38d14ad30f20dad4e7806d8960b9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/23b429ade6e38d14ad30f20dad4e7806d8960b9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/9d4eb0ccac34da1a0dfd69b56d462c37ef0116fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_