ner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/fa2862074fd2d6e1b4c1d29ec27b67017aeb0c7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-24T17:56:48Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-24T17:56:48Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"feat(a11y): add document title management hooks (Priority 1.4)\n\nAdd useDocumentTitle and useDocumentTitleFromRoute hooks for proper page\ntitle management, enabling WCAG 2.4.2 Page Titled compliance. Document\ntitles are now automatically updated based on the current route.\n\nChanges:\n- Create useDocumentTitle hook for manual title control\n- Create useDocumentTitleFromRoute hook with route-to-title mapping\n- Include DEFAULT_ROUTE_TITLES for common application routes\n- Integrate automatic title updates in Shell app\n- Add 22 unit tests for document title hooks\n\nNote: lang=\"en\" attribute already present in index.html for WCAG 3.1.1\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f1c5e306f28bb1ce3c841318f14505ac1ac4cd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/7f1c5e306f28bb1ce3c841318f14505ac1ac4cd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/fa2862074fd2d6e1b4c1d29ec27b67017aeb0c7b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/us