m/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/0c94ba355b0f7bee9b638188cf35865f988db36d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-24T17:51:10Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-24T17:51:10Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"feat(a11y): implement ARIA live regions and route announcements (Priority 1.3)\n\nAdd useAnnounce hook and LiveRegion component for screen reader announcements,\nenabling WCAG 4.1.3 Status Messages compliance. Screen reader users will now\nbe notified of route changes, form submissions, and dynamic content updates.\n\nChanges:\n- Create useAnnounce hook for programmatic screen reader announcements\n- Create useRouteAnnouncer hook for automatic page navigation announcements\n- Create LiveRegion component for declarative ARIA live regions\n- Integrate route announcer in Shell app for navigation accessibility\n- Add 27 unit tests for accessibility hooks\n- Add 21 unit tests for LiveRegion component\n- Update shared-utils Jest config for jsdom environment\n- Exclude test directory from production build in tsconfig.app.json\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3101f205616cb507a05e0cbf5e23ec5108f8e3bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/3101f205616cb507a05e0cbf5e23ec5108f8e3bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack