udit() for container audits\n  - axePresets for different testing scenarios\n  - Utility functions: isFocusable(), getFocusableElements(), calculateContrastRatio()\n- Add comprehensive accessibility tests for shared-design-system components:\n  - Button, Input, PasswordInput, Alert, Badge, Card, Loading, Skeleton\n  - Select, StatusBadge, ThemeToggle, Toast, SocialLoginButtons, Label\n  - Form patterns with proper ARIA attributes\n- Create Playwright E2E accessibility audit tests (a11y-audit.spec.ts):\n  - Tests for unauthenticated pages (Sign In, Sign Up)\n  - Tests for authenticated pages (Payments, Profile, Admin)\n  - Keyboard navigation verification\n  - Focus management tests\n  - ARIA attributes and landmarks validation\n  - Color contrast checks\n- Add npm scripts: test:a11y, test:a11y:design-system, test:e2e:a11y\n- Update ACCESSIBILITY-COMPLIANCE-PLAN.md with completion status\n\nAlso fixes Express 5 type compatibility issue with express-rate-limit v7\nby casting rate limiters to RequestHandler type.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"93aa5a99574e3cabbf6ec2eca05669c19e95f6df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/93aa5a99574e3cabbf6ec2eca05669c19e95f6df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/ea7be6f8eebed5977a208f4a33c296242342700c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pa