ment.documentElement.dir attribute\n2. Fix E2E test to use toHaveText instead of invalid toMatch matcher\n3. Fix currency E2E test to use toHaveText instead of toMatch\n4. Add data-testid attributes to LanguageSwitcher component for E2E tests\n5. Make eager setting consistent (eager: true) for shared-i18n in all\n   Module Federation shared dependencies config examples\n6. Update CI script to use i18n-report.js output instead of missing\n   i18n-coverage.js script\n7. Remove unused HttpBackend import and add clarifying comment about\n   bundled vs dynamic translation loading\n8. (Covered by #4)\n9. Remove unused SUPPORTED_LOCALES import in LanguageSwitcher component\n10. Fix corrupted Hindi string \"हाल के लेनदे���\" → \"हाल के लेनदेन\"\n11. Add clarifying note about i18next locale tags (en/hi) vs Intl API\n    locale tags (en-IN/hi-IN) distinction\n12. Add ''text'' language identifier to fenced code block (MD040)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c30579080ebe1fc70362f9283b7ff2790f9e209","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/1c30579080ebe1fc70362f9283b7ff2790f9e209"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/dabfa40fb4138b6a5464b9a3060d29951d21a5ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateat