786e94cb5ac8fa79b4fb6bb584ff53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-24T15:48:33Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-24T15:48:33Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"fix(a11y): address code review feedback on accessibility plan\n\nAddress CodeRabbit and GitHub Copilot review comments:\n\n1. Remove redundant sr-only spans from Loading and Skeleton components\n   (aria-label is sufficient for screen reader announcements)\n\n2. Add note about shared-test-utils library needing to be created first\n\n3. Remove redundant aria-describedby from Table (caption auto-associates)\n\n4. Refactor TableHead to use button element for sortable columns\n   (provides better semantics and automatic keyboard support)\n\n5. Add implementation note about React.cloneElement fragility in FormField\n   (recommend compound component pattern for robust implementations)\n\n6. Add note about Lighthouse CI only testing unauthenticated pages\n   with guidance for testing authenticated routes\n\n7. Add color-contrast-calc to dependencies list (used by contrast audit)\n\n8. Add SSR/test environment check for Dialog portal rendering\n\n9. Use specific data-testid selectors in E2E tests instead of broad regex\n\n10. Fix HTML file path (apps/shell/index.html not src/) and mark lang task\n    as complete (already has lang=\"en\")\n\n11. Pin Lighthouse CI action to specific commit SHA for supply chain security\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"589bb994627433fc2881810d08bb0b463abcd9a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/589bb994627433fc2881810d08bb0b463abcd9a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/b34012c6fa786e94cb5ac8fa79b4fb6bb584ff53","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"