com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/4c4d5ad18f11a0fa0a890326d4bb15ad16671575/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-24T15:30:07Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-24T15:30:07Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"docs(a11y): add comprehensive WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility compliance plan\n\nAdd detailed implementation plan for achieving full WCAG 2.1 AA compliance:\n\n- 4 phases with 15 priorities covering all accessibility areas\n- Phase 1: Foundation (jest-axe, skip links, ARIA live regions, form a11y)\n- Phase 2: Enhanced components (focus trapping, tables, color contrast)\n- Phase 3: Comprehensive testing (E2E a11y tests, documentation)\n- Phase 4: CI/CD integration (Lighthouse CI, accessibility gates)\n\nIncludes code examples for:\n- useAnnounce hook for screen reader announcements\n- useFocusTrap hook for modal focus management\n- Accessible FormField, Dialog, and Table components\n- E2E accessibility test patterns with @axe-core/playwright\n\nEstimated effort: ~46 hours across all phases\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80902bd8d6f3bd7acf1b538621792715482845fc