https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/commits/2b1d6047e81b91448fde837b5eb088885296b40b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-24T10:31:45Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-24T10:31:45Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"security(oauth): add security audit and OAuth-specific rate limiting\n\nPhase 4.3 Security Audit completed:\n\n- Add OAuth rate limiter (10 req/15min) for initiation endpoints\n  - GET /api/auth/oauth/:provider (OAuth flow initiation)\n  - POST /api/auth/oauth/link/:provider (account linking)\n- Fix sensitive data logging in OAuthCallback.tsx\n  - Now logs boolean indicators instead of full URL/hash with tokens\n- Create comprehensive security audit document (OAUTH-SECURITY-AUDIT.md)\n\nSecurity checklist verified:\n- CSRF protection via 256-bit state parameter\n- State stored in Redis with 10-min TTL (one-time use)\n- OAuth tokens encrypted with AES-256-GCM\n- No sensitive data in frontend logs\n- OAuth callback validates state\n- OAuth-specific rate limiting implemented\n- Audit logging via RabbitMQ events\n- Email verification required for account linking\n- Cannot link account already linked to another user\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"525d71ae82340542797f7de52fd0ebf0e608e713","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/trees/525d71ae82340542797f7de52fd0ebf0e608e713"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/payments-system-mfe-microservices-fullstack-nx-2026/git/commits/2b1d6047e81b91448fde837b5eb088885296b40b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":