ility addressed via package updates\n\n### MODERATE\n- **nodemailer**: Upgraded from 6.10.0 to 7.0.7\n  - Email to unintended domain vulnerability\n- **cookie** (via csurf): Added resolution to force 0.7.0+\n  - Out of bounds characters vulnerability\n- **quill**: XSS vulnerability (disputed) - acknowledged in docs\n\n## Package Changes\n\n### Backend (apps/medi-aide-backend)\n- jspdf: ^3.0.1 → ^4.0.0\n- nodemailer: ^6.10.0 → ^7.0.7\n- csurf: ^1.2.2 → csrf-csrf: ^3.0.0 (replaced deprecated package)\n- aws-sdk: removed (using @aws-sdk/client-* v3 already present)\n- Added overrides for cookie, nodemailer\n\n### Frontend (apps/medi-aide-frontend)\n- jspdf: ^3.0.0 → ^4.0.0\n\n### Packages\n- Updated NestJS dependencies to v11.x for consistency\n- Updated OpenTelemetry dependencies to latest compatible versions\n\n## Verification\n- pnpm audit: No known vulnerabilities found","tree":{"sha":"f523dbe1c97f3e7dd3f0f157f2fdc65bc807c142","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/trees/f523dbe1c97f3e7dd3f0f157f2fdc65bc807c142"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/commits/dd6b5a4e52846603203608305404b5c62f9fdc85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140000494?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ikay72","id":140000494,"login":"ikay72","node_id":"U_kgDOCFg87g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commit/dd6b5a4e52846603203608305404b5c62f9fdc85","node_id":"C_kwDOQj3JodoAKGRkNmI1YTRlNTI4NDY2MDMyMDM2MDgzMDU0MDRiNWM2MmY5ZmRjODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commit/2aededf92a1147ed8136086f827f40298fd9e57e","sha":"2aededf92a1147ed8136086f827f40298fd9e57e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commits/2aededf92a1147ed8136086f827f40298fd9e57e"}],"sha":"dd6b5a4e52846603203608305404b5c62f9fdc85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commits/dd6b5a4e52846603203608305404b5c62f9fdc85"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140000494?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ikay72","id":140000494,"login":"ikay72","node_id":"U_kgDOCFg87g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commits/2aededf92a1147ed8136086f827f40298fd9e57e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-09T22:28:40Z","email":"ikay.chigozie@tretennetworks.com","name":"ikay72"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-09T22:28:40Z","email":"ikay.chigozie@tretennetworks.com","name":"ikay72"},"message":"feat: Complete Stage 3 Microservices Migration (Phases 1-17 + Gap Resolution)\n\n## Summary\nComplete monolith to microservices migration with 100% Kong route parity.\n\n## Phases Completed\n\n### Core Phases (1-17)\n- Phase 4: Security & Compliance Services (Fraud, Security, Provincial, Feature Flags)\n- Phase 5A-5I: Domain Services Enhancement (135+ entities)\n- Phase 6: Database Migrations (141 entities, 12 services)\n- Phase 7: Integration Testing Framework\n- Phase 8: CI/CD Pipeline (GitHub Actions, Helm, ArgoCD)\n- Phase 9: Security Hardening (Encryption, RBAC, HIPAA)\n- Phase 10: Observability (Tracing, Metrics, Logging)\n- Phase 11: API Documentation (Swagger, Postman)\n- Phase 12: Load Testing (K6 framework)\n- Phase 13: Disaster Recovery (Backup/Restore, Runbooks)\n- Phase 14: Mobile App Enhancements (Offline, GPS, Biometric)\n- Phase 15: AI/ML Features (Matching, Predictions, NLP)\n- Phase 16: Multi-Tenancy (Isolation, Billing, Branding)\n- Phase 17: Internationalization (en-CA, fr-CA)\n\n### Gap Resolution Phases\n- Phase 1: Kong Legacy Path Aliases (139 paths)\n- Phase 2: Additional Route Coverage (66 paths)\n- Phase 3: Validation & Testing Framework\n\n## Key Deliverables\n- 42 microservices\n- 117 Kong services with 185+ routes\n- 16 shared packages\n- 200+ TypeORM entities\n- 100% monolith route parity\n\n## New Packages\n- @medi-aide/ai-ml\n- @medi-aide/multi-tenancy\n- @medi-aide/i18n\n- @medi-aide/security\n- @medi-aide/caching\n- @medi-aide/performance\n- @medi-aide/testing\n- @medi-aide/api-docs\n- @medi-aide/mobile-core\n- @medi-aide/observability\n\n## Synchronization System\n- detect-monolith-changes.sh\n- check-parity.sh\n- parity-check.yml workflow\n- Pre-push git hook\n\n## Documentation\n- MIGRATION_STATUS_REPORT.md\n- MONOLITH_TO_MICROSERVICE_MAPPING.md\n- PHASE3_VALIDATION_COMPLETE.md\n- KONG_GATEWAY_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md","tree":{"sha":"d44e374c683a461eee4ff0e30cba1aae564e2b79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/trees/d44e374c683a461eee4ff0e30cba1aae564e2b79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/commits/2aededf92a1147ed8136086f827f40298fd9e57e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140000494?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ikay72","id":140000494,"login":"ikay72","node_id":"U_kgDOCFg87g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commit/2aededf92a1147ed8136086f827f40298fd9e57e","node_id":"C_kwDOQj3JodoAKDJhZWRlZGY5MmExMTQ3ZWQ4MTM2MDg2ZjgyN2Y0MDI5OGZkOWU1N2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commit/0ff227252a88c11ee096873c42bcf884fd966ad0","sha":"0ff227252a88c11ee096873c42bcf884fd966ad0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commits/0ff227252a88c11ee096873c42bcf884fd966ad0"}],"sha":"2aededf92a1147ed8136086f827f40298fd9e57e","url":"https://api.github.com/rep