epos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commits/7d92981979aefda8f7dc9123eeb181f572135d23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-08T02:52:34Z","email":"ikay.chigozie@tretennetworks.com","name":"ikay72"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-08T02:52:34Z","email":"ikay.chigozie@tretennetworks.com","name":"ikay72"},"message":"Phase 2: Complete care-plan service with FHIR compliance and collaborative editing\n\nCare-Plan Service Enhancement (9 → 15 files):\n\nNew Entities:\n- CarePlanGoal: FHIR-compliant goal tracking with:\n  - Lifecycle status (proposed, planned, active, completed)\n  - Achievement status tracking\n  - Target and outcome measurement\n  - Progress percentage tracking\n\n- CarePlanActivity: FHIR-compliant activities with:\n  - Multiple activity kinds (appointments, tasks, procedures)\n  - Scheduling with timing patterns\n  - Assignment and completion tracking\n  - Status transitions\n\n- CareTeamMember: Collaborative care team with:\n  - Role-based permissions\n  - Period tracking\n  - Contact information\n\n- CarePlanRevision: Full revision history for:\n  - Create/update tracking\n  - Goal and activity changes\n  - Team member changes\n  - Comments and approvals\n  - CRDT state support for real-time collaboration\n\nEnhanced CarePlan Entity:\n- FHIR R4 compliant fields (status, intent, category)\n- Version control\n- Approval workflow\n- FHIR resource ID for interoperability\n\nNew Services:\n- FHIRService: FHIR R4 conversion with:\n  - CarePlan to/from FHIR format\n  - Goal to/from FHIR format\n  - Resource validation\n\n- GoalService: Goal management with:\n  - CRUD operations\n  - Status transitions with validation\n  - Outcome recording\n  - Progress tracking\n  - Revision history\n\n- ActivityService: Activity management with:\n  - CRUD operations\n  - Start/complete/cancel workflows\n  - Assignment tracking\n  - Statistics and reporting\n\n- CollaborationService: Team collaboration with:\n  - Team member management\n  - Permission verification\n  - Revision history\n  - Comment system","tree":{"sha":"303fa199e7298b057417a1b4b108a61a46a8861e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/trees/303fa199e7298b057417a1b4b108a61a46a8861e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/commits/7d92981979aefda8f7dc9123eeb181f572135d23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140000494?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ikay72","id":140000494,"login":"ikay72","node_id":"U_kgDOCFg87g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commit/7d92981979aefda8f7dc9123eeb181f572135d23","node_id":"C_kwDOQj3JodoAKDdkOTI5ODE5NzlhZWZkYThmN2RjOTEyM2VlYjE4MWY1NzIxMzVkMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commit/c5d39f11f73747e26ea5