compatibility scoring with:\n  - Language matching\n  - Cultural alignment\n  - Religious compatibility\n  - Communication style analysis\n  - Dietary compatibility\n  - Configurable importance weighting\n\n- MatchHistoryService: Historical analysis with:\n  - Match outcome tracking\n  - Caregiver performance analysis\n  - Patient preference learning\n  - Historical boost/penalty for repeat matches\n  - Top caregiver recommendations\n  - Performance-based recommendations\n\nFeatures:\n- Batch cultural score calculation for efficiency\n- Historical compatibility adjustments (+15 to -20 points)\n- Repeat client rate tracking\n- Patient preference learning from history\n- Caregiver improvement recommendations","tree":{"sha":"d499f6e073ed23a651386bc9b544dc1e2e44c18c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/trees/d499f6e073ed23a651386bc9b544dc1e2e44c18c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/commits/c5d39f11f73747e26ea5bf74aa8f2ad9d5ffddd6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140000494?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ikay72","id":140000494,"login":"ikay72","node_id":"U_kgDOCFg87g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.g