"name":"ikay72"},"message":"Phase 2: Complete wellness service with wearables, analytics, interventions\n\nWellness Service Enhancement (30 → 42 files):\n\nNew Entities:\n- WearableDevice: Device connection management with OAuth\n- WearableSyncJob: Sync job queue and tracking\n- WellnessAlert: Alerting system for wellness concerns\n- WellnessGoal: Goal tracking with milestones\n- WellnessAnalytics: Aggregated analytics storage\n\nNew Services:\n- WearableService: OAuth flow, device sync, data collection\n- AnalyticsService: Trend analysis, predictive analytics, insights\n- InterventionService: Rule-based interventions, alert management\n- ConsentService: GDPR compliance, consent management\n\nNew Controllers:\n- WearableController: Device connection, sync endpoints\n- AnalyticsController: Summary, trends, predictions\n- InterventionController: Evaluate, complete, dismiss interventions\n\nUpdated Enums:\n- Added new InterventionTypes: SLEEP_HYGIENE, PROFESSIONAL_SUPPORT, etc.\n\nFeatures:\n- Wearable OAuth integration (Fitbit, Garmin, Apple Watch)\n- Scheduled sync jobs with retry logic\n- Predictive analytics with linear regression\n- Intervention rules engine with cooldown periods\n- GDPR consent management and data export","tree":{"sha":"8b063722f1f2fcdd246436e9cd5bc4e1c3904582","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/trees/8b063722f1f2fcdd246436e9cd5bc4e1c3904582"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/commits/475e13e2c146fc7ea1ea3e4a35bb75aabf354bfc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140000494?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay