udit, agency\n\n## Kafka Event Publishing Integration\n- Integrated @medi-aide/kafka-client into 10 services\n- Added KafkaModule.forRootAsync() with dead-letter queue support\n- Created SchedulingEventPublisher for scheduling events\n- Configured groupId per service for proper consumer groups\n\n## Temporal Workflows Deployment\n- Created services/temporal-worker/ as standalone worker service\n- Integrated with @medi-aide/temporal-workflows-examples\n- Added health and metrics endpoints (8080, 9000)\n- Created TemporalClientService for care-request workflow triggers\n- Added to docker-compose.services-v2.yml\n\n## Service-to-Service JWT Authentication\n- Integrated @medi-aide/service-auth into 9 services\n- Added ServiceAuthModule.forRootAsync() configuration\n- Configured allowedServices per service for secure communication\n- Added SERVICE_JWT_SECRET to docker-compose environment\n\n## Updated Services (9 total)\n- auth-service\n- user-service\n- care-request-service\n- scheduling-service\n- notification-service\n- matching-service\n- evv-service\n- audit-service\n- agency-service\n\n## New Files Created\n- services/temporal-worker/package.json\n- services/temporal-worker/src/index.ts\n- services/temporal-worker/Dockerfile\n- services/care-request-service/src/services/temporal-client.service.ts\n- services/scheduling-service/src/services/scheduling-event-publisher.service.ts\n\n## Docker Compose Updates\n- Added temporal-worker service\n- Added SERVICE_JWT_SECRET to common environment\n- Added TEMPORAL_NAMESPACE and KAFKA_GROUP_ID_SUFFIX","tree":{"sha":"28b875777de915cfdbfcdc67c2676863305ca577","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/trees/28b875777de915cfdbfcdc67c2676863305ca577"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/commits/a3989410920015ead86a88ab3ebcf7827f501f93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"