000494,"login":"ikay72","node_id":"U_kgDOCFg87g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commits/99e9fa6666811034fb1b6f218f86013b320accae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-26T20:55:24Z","email":"ikay.chigozie@tretennetworks.com","name":"ikay72"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-26T20:55:24Z","email":"ikay.chigozie@tretennetworks.com","name":"ikay72"},"message":"feat(phase3): Complete CI/CD, observability, and Kubernetes infrastructure\n\nPhase 3 Implementation - Enterprise-Grade Infrastructure\n\n## CI/CD Pipeline\n- GitHub Actions workflow for all 20+ microservices\n- Matrix builds with Docker BuildKit and GHCR\n- Trivy security scanning integration\n- Environment-based deployments (staging/production)\n- Manual service build workflow for individual deployments\n\n## Observability Stack\n### Prometheus\n- Comprehensive scrape configuration for all services\n- 25+ alert rules across 6 categories\n- Service health, database, Kafka, Redis, Temporal alerts\n- HIPAA compliance and EVV-specific monitoring\n\n### Grafana\n- Microservices overview dashboard\n- Matching service analytics dashboard\n- EVV compliance dashboard\n- Auto-provisioned datasources (Prometheus, Jaeger, Loki)\n\n### Distributed Tracing (Jaeger)\n- Elasticsearch backend for production scale\n- Per-service sampling strategies\n- OTLP support for modern instrumentation\n\n### Log Aggregation (Loki + Promtail)\n- Structured JSON log parsing\n- Trace ID correlation with Jaeger\n- 30-day retention configuration\n\n### Alertmanager\n- Multi-channel routing (Slack, Email, PagerDuty)\n- Team-based alert routing\n- HIPAA violation immediate escalation\n\n## Kubernetes Preparation\n### Helm Charts\n- Complete chart with 10 templates\n- 16 services pre-configured\n- HorizontalPodAutoscaler (2-10 replicas)\n- PodDisruptionBudgets for HA\n- NetworkPolicies for security\n- ServiceMonitors for Prometheus\n\n### Security\n- Non-root containers (UID 10001)\n- Pod anti-affinity for distribution\n- TLS ingress with cert-manager\n- Secret templates for credentials\n\nFiles created: 27\nDashboards: 3\nAlert rules: 25+\nHelm templates: 10","tree":{"sha":"44deb45d5bd88ed90e3585937727465c6e3a0f6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/trees/44deb45d5bd88ed90e3585937727465c6e3a0f6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/commits/99e9fa6666811034fb1b6f218f86013b320accae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140000494?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ikay72","id":140000494,"login":"ikay72","node_id":"U_kgDOCFg87g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/