nge\n- MfaController for multi-factor authentication\n- ProfileController for user preferences\n- RoleController for RBAC management\n- VerificationController for EVV clock-in/out\n- GpsController for location tracking\n- ComplianceController for EVV state reporting\n\nDATABASE INITIALIZATION:\n- scripts/init-databases.sql: SQL init script\n- scripts/init-databases.sh: Automated setup for 35 databases\n\nSERVICE COMPLETION STATUS:\n- ai-ml-service: 46 Python files (FastAPI)\n- agency-service: 37 TypeScript files\n- notification-service: 23 TypeScript files\n- matching-service: 21 TypeScript files\n- caregiver-service: 19 TypeScript files\n- All services: Health endpoints ready\n\nTOTAL: 35 Microservices at 100% scaffolding","tree":{"sha":"49364aa298cc476839fc2c9ac82b6ead765e05fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/trees/49364aa298cc476839fc2c9ac82b6ead765e05fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/commits/fbd905eb4f14903beeeb7e3702fd1dae833fe989","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140000494?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ikay72","id":140000494,"login":"ikay72","node_id":"U_kgDOCFg87g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/subscriptions","type":"User","ur