":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-06T18:54:56Z","email":"ikay.chigozie@tretennetworks.com","name":"ikay72"},"message":"feat: initial monorepo setup with microservices architecture\n\nStage 3 Implementation - Complete Microservices Platform:\n\nInfrastructure:\n- Docker Compose configuration for all services\n- Kong API Gateway setup\n- Consul service discovery\n- Observability stack (Jaeger, Prometheus, Grafana)\n\nMicroservices (17 services):\n- notification-service, auth-service, user-service\n- visit-service, wellness-service, payment-service\n- analytics-service, audit-service, ai-service\n- care-plan-service, evv-service, file-service\n- search-service, matching-service (Uber-grade AI)\n- training-service, feedback-service, communication-service\n\nMatching Service (Phase 3 & 4):\n- AI Scoring with parallel processing\n- Redis Geo for sub-5ms proximity search\n- Kafka event streaming\n- Feature Store with 35+ ML features\n- Multi-backend ML Model Serving\n- A/B Testing Framework\n\nShared Packages:\n- @medi-aide/common-types, service-framework\n- consul-integration, health-check, observability\n- api-client, domain-events\n\nKubernetes & CI/CD:\n- Base manifests, ArgoCD integration\n- GitHub Actions, Security scanning\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: 22035ca166984098e8db40d22bac87ca1cb14a3f","tree":{"sha":"09dd1a84cb12565d63c43455eb6ded2e6dadf60e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/trees/09dd1a84cb12565d63c43455eb6ded2e6dadf60e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/commits/28a51900752e0c6e1b81e23b22ac8c63e0574e16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140000494?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ikay72","id":140000494,"login":"ikay72","node_id":"U_kgDOCFg87g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commit/28a51900752e0c6e1b81e23b22ac8c63e0574e16","node_id":"C_kwDOQj3JodoAKDI4YTUxOTAwNzUyZTBjNmUxYjgxZTIzYjIyYWM4YzYzZTA1NzRlMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commit/0576d6f44fa7dc7c3b4787a56c3ce39a8bdedd6f","sha":"0576d6f44fa7dc7c3b4787a56c3ce39a8bdedd6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commits/0576d6f44fa7dc7c3b4787a56c3ce39a8bdedd6f"}],"sha":"28a51900752e0c6e1b81e23b22ac8c63e0574e16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commits/28a51900752e0c6e1b81e23b22ac8c63e0574e16"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140000494?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ikay72","id":140000494,"login":"ikay72","node_id":"U_kgDOCFg87g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commits/0576d6f44fa7dc7c3b4787a56c3ce39a8bdedd6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-06T18:32:38Z","email":"ikay.chigozie@tretennetworks.com","name":"ikay72"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-06T18:32:38Z","email":"ikay.chigozie@tretennetworks.com","name":"ikay72"},"message":"feat(matching-service): implement Uber-grade AI matching microservice\n\nPhase 3 & 4 Implementation:\n\nEntities:\n- CaregiverMatch: Store match results with full breakdown\n- MatchingMetric: Performance and SLA tracking\n- CaregiverLocation: H3-indexed geospatial data\n\nServices:\n- AIScoringService: Parallel processing with circuit breaker\n- MatchingOrchestratorService: Workflow coordination with Kafka events\n- CandidateFetcherService: Database and Redis-based candidate retrieval\n- RedisGeoService: Sub-5ms proximity search\n- KafkaProducerService: Real-time event streaming\n- MatchingMetricsService: SLA monitoring and compliance\n- FeatureStoreService: ML feature engineering and caching\n- MLModelServingService: Multi-backend model inference\n- ABTestingService: Full experimentation framework\n\nControllers:\n- MatchingController: REST API for matching operations\n\nExpected Performance:\n- Candidate fetch: < 5ms (Redis Geo)\n- AI scoring: < 10ms/candidate\n- Total matching: < 3s (SLA target)\n\nFeatures:\n- Parallel chunk processing (10 candidates/chunk)\n- Circuit breaker with heuristic fallback\n- Kafka event streaming for notifications\n- Redis caching with TTL\n- A/B testing with statistical analysis\n- Shadow mode for ML model comparison","tree":{"sha":"4fa2a226fd20f8d06a9ddb15d49a9ec880b20eac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/trees/4fa2a226fd20f8d06a9ddb15d49a9ec880b20eac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/git/commits/0576d6f44fa7dc7c3b4787a56c3ce39a8bdedd6f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140000494?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ikay72","id":140000494,"login":"ikay72","node_id":"U_kgDOCFg87g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ikay72","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commit/0576d6f44fa7dc7c3b4787a56c3ce39a8bdedd6f","node_id":"C_kwDOQj3JodoAKDA1NzZkNmY0NGZhN2RjN2MzYjQ3ODdhNTZjM2NlMzlhOGJkZWRkNmY","parents":[],"sha":"0576d6f44fa7dc7c3b4787a56c3ce39a8bdedd6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commits/0576d6f44fa7dc7c3b4787a56c3ce39a8bdedd6f"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/medi-platform/medi-aide-microservices/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=f9f0c7a0d3a4a9edd96b17cd2da754252d085e8a&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A36%3A01.034Z"}');
