r":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101053705?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZHOUKAILIAN","id":101053705,"login":"ZHOUKAILIAN","node_id":"U_kgDOBgX1CQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZHOUKAILIAN/claude-community-plugins/commits/0ec5c068ad1eacd3b245ef33f81c2ee87414403c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T03:09:13Z","email":"zhoukailian@meituan.com","name":"zhoukailian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T03:09:13Z","email":"zhoukailian@meituan.com","name":"zhoukailian"},"message":"feat(ai-doc-driven-dev): v1.3.0 - English templates for CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md\n\n## Changes\n\n### New Templates\n- Add `claude-md-template.md` - English workflow and doc structure template\n- Add `agents-md-template.md` - English AI workflow process template\n- Add `templates/README.md` - Template documentation and usage guide\n\n### Template Updates\n- Remove Chinese template `claude-md-enforcement-template.md`\n- Replace with direct, process-oriented English templates\n- Use 302-redirect style links to detailed docs in `docs/` directory\n- Remove complex content (prompt libraries, checklists)\n\n### Agent Updates\n- Update `doc-flow-initializer` to use English templates\n- Update `doc-flow-updater` to use English templates\n- Simplify agent instructions to focus on workflow process\n- Remove AI-human collaboration explanations\n\n### Command Updates\n- Update `init-doc-driven-dev` documentation\n- Update `update-doc-driven-dev` documentation\n- Clarify English-only output\n- Update example structures\n\n### Design Principles\n- ✅ All generated files in English\n- ✅ Direct workflow instructions (no collaboration explanations)\n- ✅ Link-based references to detailed docs (302-redirect style)\n- ✅ Simplified content (removed prompt libraries, checklists)\n- ✅ Separation of concerns (CLAUDE.md = workflow, AGENTS.md = AI rules)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9da73c5ef0b68a371694a1dbc9ef589ff4ecfcdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZHOUKAILIAN/claude-community-plugins/git/trees/9da73c5ef0b68a371694a1dbc9ef589ff4ecfcdc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZHOUKAILIAN/claude-community-plugins/git/commits/0ec5c068ad1eacd3b245ef33f81c2ee87414403c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101053705?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZHOUKAILIAN","id":101053705,"login":"ZHOUKAILIAN","node_id":"U_kgDOBgX1CQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscrip