oken expiry, memory usage, log errors, port availability)\n- /openclaw-update-token: automated token sync workflow with\n  validation and service restart\n\nImplementation:\n- Two command definitions with detailed instructions\n- Bash diagnostic script for remote execution\n- Python token sync script\n- Complete bilingual documentation (EN/ZH)\n- Troubleshooting guide with common solutions\n\nDesign:\n- Environment-based configuration (no hardcoded credentials)\n- SSH-based secure communication\n- JSON-formatted diagnostic results\n- Comprehensive error handling\n\nDocs:\n- Requirements: REQ-20260314\n- Technical design: TECH-20260314\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5094cf3d140e2ac2831ac55da843966c6497af0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZHOUKAILIAN/claude-community-plugins/git/trees/f5094cf3d140e2ac2831ac55da843966c6497af0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZHOUKAILIAN/claude-community-plugins/git/commits/57ca1c3b9b5a87d98fccec51fc891f9688663cdb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101053705?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ZHOUKAILIAN","id":101053705,"login":"ZHOUKAILIAN","node_id":"U_kgDOBgX1CQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAI