com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZHOUKAILIAN","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZHOUKAILIAN/claude-community-plugins/commits/aad4a0e5b56e8ee5104ea2c0b6815e8a434de86d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-17T14:08:57Z","email":"zhoukailian@meituan.com","name":"zhoukailian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-17T14:08:57Z","email":"zhoukailian@meituan.com","name":"zhoukailian"},"message":"feat: implement scan optimization for enforce-doc-workflow command\n\nImplement REQ-006 to add user-controlled scanning for the\nenforce-doc-workflow command, improving performance and user experience.\n\nChanges:\n- Update enforce-doc-workflow.md command definition\n  - Add scan confirmation section with user options\n  - Add --scan parameter support (yes/no)\n  - Add three usage examples (interactive, auto-scan, skip)\n  - Document scan purpose and scope\n\n- Update doc-detector/SKILL.md\n  - Add note about optional scanning capability\n  - Explain behavior when scan is skipped\n\n- Update claude-md-enforcer/SKILL.md\n  - Add note about working with/without full scan\n  - Mark standards synchronization as optional\n\n- Update README.md and README-zh.md (bilingual)\n  - Add new Commands section\n  - Document enforce-doc-workflow command features\n  - Provide usage examples and workflow\n\nImplementation follows TECH-006 technical design specification.\nUsers can now choose whether to scan repository, with options for:\n- Interactive prompt (default): Ask before scanning\n- Auto-scan mode: --scan=yes\n- Skip scan mode: --scan=no\n\nThis improves startup time for repeated executions while maintaining\nflexibility for users who need fresh scan results.","tree":{"sha":"1445e7c57c8227dce378e57e52b6fadb4c1294e4","