comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-10T08:32:13Z","email":"holon521@gmail.com","name":"holon521"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-10T08:32:13Z","email":"holon521@gmail.com","name":"holon521"},"message":"feat: Refactor ZIA core modules\n\nThis commit refactors the core ZIA modules, including `index.tsx`, `knowledge_archive.ts`, `memory_orchestrator.ts`, `compute_swarm.ts`, and `fde_logic.ts`. The primary goals of this refactoring are to:\n\n- **Simplify `index.tsx`**: Remove unnecessary imports and complex state management, focusing on core application logic.\n- **Enhance `knowledge_archive.ts`**: Introduce architectural self-awareness and enforce strict JSON formatting for knowledge nodes.\n- **Improve `memory_orchestrator.ts`**: Implement snapshot/restore functionality and auto-seeding from specs for robust memory management.\n- **Update `compute_swarm.ts`**: Refine the hyper-graph computing grid with new node types, statuses, and improved metrics.\n- **Streamline `fde_logic.ts`**: Shift heavy mathematical operations to Python workers, using this module solely for client-side checksums and lightweight signature generation.","tree":{"sha":"0121411129804a004540e61723aebe0f62690979","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/git/trees/0121411129804a004540e61723aebe0f62690979"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/git/commits/44093c27863408e874b8d8056116fd53ffe4da0d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212362330?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/holon521","id":212362330,"login":"holon521","node_id":"U_kgDODKhkWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/holon521/-AI-/commit/44093c27863408e874b8d8056116fd53ffe4da0d","node_id":"C_kwDOQkNcaNoAKDQ0MDkzYzI3ODYzNDA4ZTg3NGI4ZDgwNTYxMTZmZDUzZmZlNGRhMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/holon521/-AI-/commit/b57545f5daf43c37a1354c9cbdfda12c3885f79a","sha":"b57545f5daf43c37a1354c9cbdfda12c3885f79a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/commits/b57545f5daf43c37a1354c9cbdfda12c3885f79a"}],"sha":"44093c27863408e874b8d8056116fd53ffe4da0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/commits/44093c27863408e874b8d8056116fd53ffe4da0d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212362330?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/holon521","id":212362330,"login":"holon521","node_id":"U_kgDODKhkWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/commits/b57545f5daf43c37a1354c9cbdfda12c3885f79a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-09T14:54:01Z","email":"holon521@gmail.com","name":"holon521"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-09T14:54:01Z","email":"holon521@gmail.com","name":"holon521"},"message":"feat: Enhance ZIA OS with advanced math and worker script support\n\nIntegrates new mathematical concepts like Category Theory, Topological Data Analysis, Active Inference, and Tropical Geometry into the knowledge archive. Updates the Google Drive bridge to support manual token setting and introduces a Python worker script template for advanced computation and browser automation via Google Colab. This significantly expands ZIA''s cognitive and computational capabilities.","tree":{"sha":"f3d83786a8af9eee8dd3e6a967721650f15dd034","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/git/trees/f3d83786a8af9eee8dd3e6a967721650f15dd034"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/git/commits/b57545f5daf43c37a1354c9cbdfda12c3885f79a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212362330?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/holon521","id":212362330,"login":"holon521","node_id":"U_kgDODKhkWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/holon521/-AI-/commit/b57545f5daf43c37a1354c9cbdfda12c3885f79a","node_id":"C_kwDOQkNcaNoAKGI1NzU0NWY1ZGFmNDNjMzdhMTM1NGM5Y2JkZmRhMTJjMzg4NWY3OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/holon521/-AI-/commit/b8998bef5e98e52f2e945e51482d3de22eb91aa5","sha":"b8998bef5e98e52f2e945e51482d3de22eb91aa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/commits/b8998bef5e98e52f2e945e51482d3de22eb91aa5"}],"sha":"b57545f5daf43c37a1354c9cbdfda12c3885f79a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/commits/b57545f5daf43c37a1354c9cbdfda12c3885f79a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212362330?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/holon521","id":212362330,"login":"holon521","node_id":"U_kgDODKhkWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/commits/b8998bef5e98e52f2e945e51482d3de22eb91aa5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-08T01:28:22Z","email":"holon521@gmail.com","name":"holon521"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-08T01:28:22Z","email":"holon521@gmail.com","name":"holon521"},"message":"feat: Integrate Google Identity Services and Drive Bridge\n\nIntroduces Google Identity Services (GIS) for OAuth 2.0 authentication with Google Drive.\nImplements a Drive Bridge pattern to use Google Drive as a message queue for secure and stable communication with compute nodes like Google Colab.\nAdds initial support for Kaggle integration via Colab.\nIncludes CSS for custom scrollbars and animations, and imports necessary Google scripts.\nUpdates dependency versions and refactors `package.json`.","tree":{"sha":"13a92d43f7acf179d787d3b51d2534e014e0eb14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/git/trees/13a92d43f7acf179d787d3b51d2534e014e0eb14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/git/commits/b8998bef5e98e52f2e945e51482d3de22eb91aa5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212362330?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/holon521","id":212362330,"login":"holon521","node_id":"U_kgDODKhkWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/holon521/-AI-/commit/b8998bef5e98e52f2e945e51482d3de22eb91aa5","node_id":"C_kwDOQkNcaNoAKGI4OTk4YmVmNWU5OGU1MmYyZTk0NWU1MTQ4MmQzZGUyMmViOTFhYTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/holon521/-AI-/commit/26ee972ce0fe8d2e3b88e35652558a4e98913891","sha":"26ee972ce0fe8d2e3b88e35652558a4e98913891","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/commits/26ee972ce0fe8d2e3b88e35652558a4e98913891"}],"sha":"b8998bef5e98e52f2e945e51482d3de22eb91aa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/commits/b8998bef5e98e52f2e945e51482d3de22eb91aa5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212362330?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/holon521","id":212362330,"login":"holon521","node_id":"U_kgDODKhkWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/commits/26ee972ce0fe8d2e3b88e35652558a4e98913891/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-07T23:37:36Z","email":"holon521@gmail.com","name":"holon521"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-07T23:37:36Z","email":"holon521@gmail.com","name":"holon521"},"message":"feat: Refactor and enhance ZIA OS architecture\n\nThis commit introduces significant structural and functional improvements to the ZIA OS, aligning with the need for a more modular and scalable architecture. Key changes include:\n\n- **Modularization:** Transitioning from a monolithic `index.tsx` to a more organized, layered structure, preparing for future expansion.\n- **Enhanced Metadata:** Enriching message and engram metadata with new fields like `refinementStatus`, `cognitiveCard`, `doubtLevel`, and `groundingMetadata` to support more nuanced AI interactions and analysis.\n- **FDE Integration:** Deeper integration of Fixed-Dimensional Encoding (FDE) logic for improved memory retrieval and similarity calculations, including Hamming distance.\n- **New System Prompt:** Introducing a dedicated `RECEPTIONIST_SYSTEM_PROMPT` to standardize initial user input analysis and intent classification.\n- **Specification Update:** Overhauling `SPECIFICATION.md` to reflect the new architecture, core philosophies (like Anti-Fragility and Benevolence Protocol), and intent categories.\n- **Knowledge Archive Expansion:** Adding new knowledge nodes, including those related to Category Theory in AI and updating existing summaries for clarity.\n- **Memory Orchestrator:** Enhancing the memory orchestrator with mathematical retrieval capabilities and new engram properties like `gemValue` and `tier`.","tree":{"sha":"c438e41b5705f77faeef2383512c8d851597112c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/git/trees/c438e41b5705f77faeef2383512c8d851597112c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/git/commits/26ee972ce0fe8d2e3b88e35652558a4e98913891","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212362330?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/holon521","id":212362330,"login":"holon521","node_id":"U_kgDODKhkWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/orgs","received_events_url":"https: