s","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-07T19:35:03Z","email":"holon521@gmail.com","name":"holon521"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-07T19:35:03Z","email":"holon521@gmail.com","name":"holon521"},"message":"feat: Initialize ZIA Holon World frontend\n\nSets up the basic HTML structure, imports necessary libraries (React, Tailwind CSS, Google Fonts), and configures the import map for CDN-hosted modules.\n\nThe `index.tsx` file is updated to initialize the GoogleGenAI client, detect the user''s environment, and integrate with the memory orchestrator and compute swarm modules. API key handling is made more robust for environments where `process.env` might not be available.\n\nThe `package.json` is updated to reflect the new dependencies.\nAdditionally, the `knowledge_archive.ts` and `memory_orchestrator.ts` files are refactored to refine their internal structures and comments, and `compute_swarm.ts` is updated to clarify its purpose and features.","tree":{"sha":"de098c331b49e5c91e9e57847189b28625b1bc4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/git/trees/de098c331b49e5c91e9e57847189b28625b1bc4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/holon521/-AI-/git/commits/aaa84533f35744be76fe46fac4f3f41f34da9c01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212362330?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/holon521","id":212362330,"login":"holon521","node_id":"U_kgDODKhkWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/holon521/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.c