1a35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T12:18:20Z","email":"prancoder@gmail.com","name":"Pranjal Singh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T12:18:20Z","email":"prancoder@gmail.com","name":"Pranjal Singh"},"message":"feat: Integrate Dodo Payments billing, secure profile settings, and notifications\n\nBilling: Implemented DodoPaymentsService using the official SDK for checkout sessions and subscription cancellations.\n\nWebhook: Added DodoWebhookController with header signature checks to handle active/renewed/expired subscription events.\n\nSettings: Built email preference toggles and secure account deletion to programmatically wipe active subscriptions and credentials.\n\nErrors: Created UserFacingErrorController to display user-friendly screens for redirect alerts, payment failures, and container errors.\n\nCompetitors: Added early pre-checks and dynamic validation in CompetitorApiController/JS to block duplicate competitor inputs and prevent console/alert logging.\n\nTemplates: Added profile settings UI, PRO upgrade page, and HTML email templates for consistency nudges and viral outlier alerts.\n\nSecurity: Configured custom OAuth2 GCM encryptors and strictly enforced complete credential/record scrubs on user deletion.\n\nSafety: Implemented server-side verifySubscription checks to guard against client-side checkout spoofing and block open-redirect inputs.","tree":{"sha":"0a20df62513a4608bbfce95d5e7e7736c9e1d2ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prancodes/SEODrift/git/trees/0a20df62513a4608bbfce95d5e7e7736c9e1d2ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prancodes/SEODrift/git/commits/2bb6847b2d8146eacdbba57363cebff961fd1a35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155365177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prancodes","id":155365177,"login":"prancodes","node_id":"U_kgDOCUKvOQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/prancodes/SEODrift/commit/2bb6847b2d8146eacdbba57363cebff961fd1a35","node_id":"C_kwDOQkQqxNoAKDJiYjY4NDdiMmQ4MTQ2ZWFjZGJiYTU3MzYzY2ViZmY5NjFmZDFhMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/prancodes/SEODrift/commit/4a39f8edb982fcd9cb79d2962303027cd5f086cd","sha":"4a39f8edb982fcd9cb79d2962303027cd5f086cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prancodes/SEODrift/commits/4a39f8edb982fcd9cb79d2962303027cd5f086cd"}],"sha":"2bb6847b2d8146eacdbba57363cebff961fd1a35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prancodes/SEODrift/commits/2bb6847b2d8146eacdbba57363cebff961fd1a35"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155365177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/prancodes","id":155365177,"login":"prancodes","node_id":"U_kgDOCUKvOQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prancodes/SEODrift/commits/4a39f8edb982fcd9cb79d2962303027cd5f086cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:57:39Z","email":"prancoder@gmail.com","name":"Pranjal Singh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:57:39Z","email":"prancoder@gmail.com","name":"Pranjal Singh"},"message":"feat: implement Keyword Velocity, Competitor Trends, Leyden AOT caching, and Encrypted OAuth2 persistence\n\nBackend & Infrastructure: Migrate from AppCDS to JDK 25 AOT Cache (Project Leyden) for serverless cold-start optimization. Implement AES-GCM encryption for database-persisted OAuth2 authorized clients. Integrate Flyway migrations V3-V6, ShedLock distributed scheduler locking, and private YouTube Analytics tracking.\n\nFrontend & UX: Add dedicated Keyword Search Velocity dashboard with Chart.js histories and cached Gemini SEO insights. Create Trends & Competitor Intelligence view featuring subscriber benchmarking and posting rhythm charts. Optimize Vite assets bundling and purge Phosphor web icons to eliminate render-blocking CSS.","tree":{"sha":"a56b68d4c051bb0bf0fcc272f3c227605b8131d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prancodes/SEODrift/git/trees/a56b68d4c051bb0bf0fcc272f3c227605b8131d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prancodes/SEODrift/git/commits/4a39f8edb982fcd9cb79d2962303027cd5f086cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155365177?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prancodes/followers","fol