github.com/users/shimon2005/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shimon2005","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asher603/Smart_Travel_Agent/commits/66f4bbd43d91c72370b4dca2c52030d81f52c5c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-28T13:39:12Z","email":"shimony2017@gmail.com","name":"Shimon Khakshour"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-28T13:39:12Z","email":"shimony2017@gmail.com","name":"Shimon Khakshour"},"message":"Enhance security measures against prompt injection attacks\n\n- Updated APIService to return detailed error messages instead of None on API errors.\n- Integrated input validation and protection in AuthPresenter, ProfilePresenter, and TripFormPresenter to prevent prompt injection.\n- Added reset_form method in AuthView to clear input fields upon navigation.\n- Implemented a comprehensive PromptGuard class for server-side prompt injection protection with various detection patterns.\n- Created a ClientPromptGuard for client-side validation and alerting, ensuring the application terminates on detection of malicious input.\n- Developed unit tests for the PromptGuard to validate detection and sanitization of inputs.\n- Improved error messages in user verification and registration processes for better user feedback.","tree":{"sha":"71102268f1fa77f4dc2305d921d7c5b311619744","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asher603/Smart_Travel_Agent/git/trees/71102268f1fa77f4dc2305d921d7c5b311619744"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asher603/Smart_Travel_Agent/git/commits/66f4bbd43d91c72370b4dca2c52030d81f52c5c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186740605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shimon2005/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shimon2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shimon20