unt (per Anysite support), so taking the\nfirst result could attach a bigger, unrelated company (acme.com.au for\nacme.com) to a lead''s analysis. Now the first result whose website is the\ndomain, or a subdomain of it, wins; otherwise no match.\n\nCo-authored-by: Nick Zeckets <nick@smokesignals.ai>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d00312359a1d543123cb2d0524c20fc0058ad90c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/git/trees/d00312359a1d543123cb2d0524c20fc0058ad90c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/git/commits/d744f16520b4c8a47ff2615998a33cb1405cb68e","verification":{"payload":"tree d00312359a1d543123cb2d0524c20fc0058ad90c\nparent 2c3c2d4e671c7e1a6795914115f84cf44211633c\nauthor Nick Zeckets <80357080+nzeckets@users.noreply.github.com> 1790465823 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790465823 -0400\n\nCompany-from-domain: only use a result whose website is the domain (#37)\n\nAnysite''s /api/linkedin/google/company matches the keyword as a substring of\ncompany websites and sorts by headcount (per Anysite support), so taking the\nfirst result could attach a bigger, unrelated company (acme.com.au for\nacme.com) to a lead''s analysis. Now the first result whose website is the\ndomain, or a subdomain of it, wins; otherwise no match.\n\nCo-authored-by: Nick Zeckets <nick@smokesignals.ai>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquFcfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJRYQAE428oLrjIGXxx0HtXUCzdJr\nvo5fstLNLYjX0UeiHEGKC2F6Cg/7edl3RRTVNifv7q9pJDmjfTzOWuGQ3nIXLXIP\nogo2n1Rs1M+YpafgVias34gPEcNMaOM1AvS7NsAlVqX43IetPJzbiKJa2xUyx72I\nV/u7EwjhDviikucqDXKB1NPQ5ZVe95My0zBnYOV77TxBSLQVkAGqcniSy2Acewuc\nC7XYfqQ+m2ssVxuMEAr71w59jiu3QEL47TSJFYPybWpWITvlqDF7oAgO6vX2tHA8\npBYn1N1K5bWUkPVCz8ywIJ2/IhMDnSORmzvNdOt/P8Sv/h6LSd1RtGdLz4x4Q6IS\nPSeMhdllTqhE5nZCAxJQjcr9v+fYy/Y78KJmJjNdGxfgtVF7tzW+5TYEXdTtBc/q\n