at 280 chars,\ncut on a word boundary, omitted entirely when neither source has text.\n\nVerified with a stubbed-Slack formatting test: line present and bounded on\nlong input, absent on empty input.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KRMY5pPWVyb4u3yFo6tqHG\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"356d637c7b0526feeb65b69fd642563f93d94d14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/git/trees/356d637c7b0526feeb65b69fd642563f93d94d14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/git/commits/0e205d07ec42d06ac8085f7ebe9d27a579c5b2e8","verification":{"payload":"tree 356d637c7b0526feeb65b69fd642563f93d94d14\nparent c2c300c49cf127debd11f72efa6084cca21df87f\nauthor Nick Zeckets <80357080+nzeckets@users.noreply.github.com> 1783643449 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783643449 -0400\n\nAdd \"what they do\" company summary to the ICP sales notification (#34)\n\nThe grade >= C sales ping (from #33) tells sales who submitted and how they\nscored, but not what the company does — the rep still had to open the\nreport or the website to find out. Add a one-line summary sourced from the\nLinkedIn company description (usually the cleanest self-description),\nfalling back to the site''s own meta description. Bounded at 280 chars,\ncut on a word boundary, omitted entirely when neither source has text.\n\nVerified with a stubbed-Slack formatting test: line present and bounded on\nlong input, absent on empty input.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KRMY5pPWVyb4u3yFo6tqHG\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUD05CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnHAQABSxxBpts/EtExutuOgSs5j2\nNprIDft9L1l/vBzSGP324znOYgWp/xJxAnu0x5F1hAA++EyvuS6nCdAL0p8z3SxF\nN0zd2zQ/zEg/3FmTHOvLodh9pZHTLHoxlvnrbnoOVtRTfmeZZQEM962/UZxJeYgz\nAhMk+pVRtVkpEmOUrSaBNhpk08rI/ggArp8XqKAXHlJkxu8ocl6jgIq6s1ptn9wc\nG+FI/qu1VrcctMMNx3I+KZ