laude"},"message":"Kill more AI slop (\"genuinely\" etc.) + first-person attribution for the reader\n\n1) Voice: removed \"genuinely\" from the prompt and banned it (plus \"truly\",\n   \"seamless\", \"elevate\", \"unlock\", \"delve\", \"leverage\", etc.) so it stops\n   appearing in the report.\n2) Attribution: when a quote comes from the reader''s own posts, or from a\n   decision-maker who IS the reader, attribute it in the second person (\"you\n   wrote\"), never \"your CEO\". Dedup the reader from the decision-makers list by\n   URN or full name and fold their posts into the reader''s own; the prompt also\n   instructs the model to treat a name-matched decision-maker as the reader.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_015xZN5Dikjgt4e47EwDJ2P8","tree":{"sha":"68a6774a945ce98d43756c83cc87e00cd65c04b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/git/trees/68a6774a945ce98d43756c83cc87e00cd65c04b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/git/commits/d957be260873028b3520c4b2407675673b3e4cd2","verification":{"payload":"tree 68a6774a945ce98d43756c83cc87e00cd65c04b3\nparent c9349bc33c31a230a738227a979fb986e6724d12\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781460460 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781460460 +0000\n\nKill more AI slop (\"genuinely\" etc.) + first-person attribution for the reader\n\n1) Voice: removed \"genuinely\" from the prompt and banned it (plus \"truly\",\n   \"seamless\", \"elevate\", \"unlock\", \"delve\", \"leverage\", etc.) so it stops\n   appearing in the report.\n2) Attribution: when a quote comes from the reader''s own posts, or from a\n   decision-maker who IS the reader, attribute it in the second person (\"you\n   wrote\"), never \"your CEO\". Dedup the reader from the decision-makers list by\n   URN or full name and fold their posts into the reader''s own; the prompt also\n   instructs the model to treat a name-matched decision-maker as the reader.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code