hub.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/commits/22023f20332aa46e54f23cccc0c3e9935c930069/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T17:44:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T17:44:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix jobs (company as set) + find person by name when email lookup misses\n\nFrom the live logs: company resolution, logo, and HubSpot tiering all work, but\nthe email->profile lookup returns nothing for nick@smokesignals.ai (no URN, so\nposts are skipped), and job search 422s because `company` must be a set.\n\n- getCompanyJobs: send company as an array (set), per the live API.\n- enrichPersonByEmail: log the response shape when email/user returns 200 with no\n  profile fields (diagnostic).\n- New searchPerson(firstName, company) via /api/linkedin/search/users. When the\n  email lookup yields no profile URN, the workstream now searches by the guessed\n  first name + resolved company name to recover the profile URN, so posts can be\n  pulled even when email->profile coverage is missing.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_015xZN5Dikjgt4e47EwDJ2P8","tree":{"sha":"912297661818c89f554fb6d376ee71fc12449345","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/git/trees/912297661818c89f554fb6d376ee71fc12449345"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/git/commits/22023f20332aa46e54f23cccc0c3e9935c930069","verification":{"payload":"tree 912297661818c89f554fb6d376ee71fc12449345\nparent 1f72256eb0b6e849e3774e0b580cf482c18a6d1c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781459090 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781459090 +0000\n\nFix jobs (company as set) + find person by name when email lookup misses\n\nFrom the live logs: company resolution, logo, and HubSpot tiering all work, but\nthe email->profile lookup returns nothing for nick@smokesignals.ai (no URN, so\nposts are skipped), and job search 422s because `company` must be a set.\n\n- getCompanyJobs: send company as an array (set), per the live API.\n- enrichPersonByEmail: log the response shape when email/user returns 200 with no\n  profile fields (diagnostic).\n- New searchPerson(firstName, company) via /api/linkedin/search/users. When the\n  email lookup yields no profile URN, the workstream now searches by the guessed\n  first name + resolved company name to recover the profile URN, so posts can be\n  pulled even when email->profile coverage is missing.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_015xZN5Dikjgt4e47EwDJ2P8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDR6WHab\nufvB0Mz/+iT77m5hVVDPHj72RpxyE9UCQBLli+SytGMkjdD8xCRtV6YHX1eJNxwQt2WsQvEt+KPx\nXAM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-14T17:44:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/re