 reliable logo, curated personalization\n\n1. Company name: title now shows the real company name (LinkedIn profile ->\n   CRM company -> domain), not the raw website the visitor typed.\n2. Logo: reliable fallback chain (Anysite LinkedIn logo -> Clearbit -> Google\n   favicon -> hide), so a logo nearly always renders.\n3. Personalization: the intro greets the reader by first name and names the\n   company. Quote curation tightened: the model may only quote the reader''s\n   posts that reveal a relevant pain/need (lead gen, pipeline, revenue\n   pressure, weak AI SDR results, signal skepticism, ABM, personalization,\n   relevance), to show they need a signal-based program. No random quotes; if\n   nothing fits, it quotes nothing.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_015xZN5Dikjgt4e47EwDJ2P8","tree":{"sha":"b996858d98572bf6aa4a915421c333e7b3835d4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/git/trees/b996858d98572bf6aa4a915421c333e7b3835d4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/git/commits/4ea3d439edccb2ae3af207e29c51b8bcd594b788","verification":{"payload":"tree b996858d98572bf6aa4a915421c333e7b3835d4e\nparent 923cb86fa4e9071331d2c33f93da8472b17965ff\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781454127 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781454127 +0000\n\nResults page: real company name, reliable logo, curated personalization\n\n1. Company name: title now shows the real company name (LinkedIn profile ->\n   CRM company -> domain), not the raw website the visitor typed.\n2. Logo: reliable fallback chain (Anysite LinkedIn logo -> Clearbit -> Google\n   favicon -> hide), so a logo nearly always renders.\n3. Personalization: the intro greets the reader by first name and names the\n   company. Quote curation tightened: the model may only quote the reader''s\n   posts that reveal a relevant pain/need (lead gen, pipeline, revenue\n   pressure, weak AI SDR results, signal skepticism, ABM, personalization,\n   