wDOQkVc4doAKDdhNjliMDI4MWZjZWMxYzQxNjQ5NjIxY2JlNzQ0YzBmODc1YTU3NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/commit/486d676d25f2fe63d85c1f535634f578040d5df2","sha":"486d676d25f2fe63d85c1f535634f578040d5df2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/commits/486d676d25f2fe63d85c1f535634f578040d5df2"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/commit/736d3172ce558baaad29270191bf2d90b7d8545d","sha":"736d3172ce558baaad29270191bf2d90b7d8545d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/commits/736d3172ce558baaad29270191bf2d90b7d8545d"}],"sha":"7a69b0281fcec1c41649621cbe744c0f875a5743","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/commits/7a69b0281fcec1c41649621cbe744c0f875a5743"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/commits/736d3172ce558baaad29270191bf2d90b7d8545d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T01:28:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T01:28:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Speed, manifesto loader, Slack concierge, deeper enrichment\n\nSpeed (perceived, no quality loss):\n- Stream the analysis over SSE and render it live as it generates, instead\n  of blocking 60-90s on a frozen bar. Same model, same tokens.\n- Cache the static system prompt with cache_control.\n- Premium tier upgraded to Opus 4.8 (same price), standard stays Sonnet 4.6.\n\nLoading experience:\n- Replace the fake progress bar with a manifesto-driven signal lifecycle\n  (Creation -> Capture -> Activation) on the navy/terracotta brand, rotating\n  manifesto principles, a rising-signal motif, and the report streaming in live.\n\nConcierge chat (AI + Slack handoff):\n- Results-page widget. AI answers grounded in the visitor''s own report and\n  steers toward a meeting. Conversations relay to a Slack channel; teammate\n  replies in the thread surface back in the widget. Env-driven, degrades\n  gracefully when Slack is not configured.\n\nDeeper enrichment (Anysite):\n- Pull the reader''s recent LinkedIn posts and the company''s open job postings\n  and feed them to the model as evidence (\"you said X\", \"you''re hiring Y\").\n- Pull the company LinkedIn profile for the results-page logo (Clearbit\n  fallback) and company facts.\n\nProgram quality:\n- Micro-app now scores deterministically from the visitor''s inputs and a\n  model-provided scoring rubric. No more random results.\n- Report reframed to prove Smoke Signals'' value and earn the meeting, with an\n  Operating Rhythm (first 30 days) and personalization to the reader.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_015xZN5Dikjgt4e47EwDJ2P8","tree":{"sha":"f2368a1e32086b8ceb630f5fafeb275fe0c150b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/git/trees/f2368a1e32086b8ceb630f5fafeb275fe0c150b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/git/commits/736d3172ce558baaad29270191bf2d90b7d8545d","verification":{"payload":"tree f2368a1e32086b8ceb630f5fafeb275fe0c150b5\nparent 486d676d25f2fe63d85c1f535634f578040d5df2\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781400493 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781400493 +0000\n\nSpeed, manifesto loader, Slack concierge, deeper enrichment\n\nSpeed (perceived, no quality loss):\n- Stream the analysis over SSE and render it live as it generates, instead\n  of blocking 60-90s on a frozen bar. Same model, same tokens.\n- Cache the static system prompt with cache_control.\n- Premium tier upgraded to Opus 4.8 (same price), standard stays Sonnet 4.6.\n\nLoading experience:\n- Replace the fake progress bar with a manifesto-driven signal lifecycle\n  (Creation -> Capture -> Activation) on the navy/terracotta brand, rotating\n  manifesto principles, a rising-signal motif, and the report streaming in live.\n\nConcierge chat (AI + Slack handoff):\n- Results-page widget. AI answers grounded in the visitor''s own report and\n  steers toward a meeting. Conversations relay to a Slack channel; teammate\n  replies in the thread surface back in the widget. Env-driven, degrades\n  gracefully when Slack is not configured.\n\nDeeper enrichment (Anysite):\n- Pull the reader''s recent LinkedIn posts and the company''s open job postings\n  and feed them to the model as evidence (\"you said X\", \"you''re hiring Y\").\n- Pull the company LinkedIn profile for the results-page logo (Clearbit\n  fallback) and company facts.\n\nProgram quality:\n- Micro-app now scores deterministically from the visitor''s inputs and a\n  model-provided scoring rubric. No more random results.\n- Report reframed to prove Smoke Signals'' value and earn the meeting, with an\n  Operating Rhythm (first 30 days) and personalization to the reader.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_015xZN5Dikjgt4e47EwDJ2P8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAA