:"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T01:46:22Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Rebuild GTM OS app: Express backend, editorial frontend, full integration layer\n\nReplace Next.js multi-step wizard with a streamlined Express app. Two inputs\n(email + website URL), parallel enrichment/scraping workstreams, AI-powered\nanalysis via Claude (Opus for HubSpot users, Sonnet for others), and a\nmagazine-style editorial results page.\n\nBackend:\n- Express server with SSE progress streaming\n- HubSpot service: contact search/create/update, property management\n- Anysite.io service: LinkedIn enrichment, BuiltWith tech stack check\n- Anthropic service: 5-section GTM analysis with parsed sections\n- Website scraper: homepage + subpage extraction\n- PDF service: branded HTML report with print-to-PDF\n- Input validation, rate limiting (3/email/day), BuiltWith caching (24h TTL)\n\nFrontend:\n- Smoke Signals editorial design system (Inter + Georgia, coral/navy palette)\n- Animated loading states with SSE progress updates\n- Markdown-to-HTML renderer for analysis sections\n- Numbered sections (01-05), pull quotes, data cards\n- HubSpot calendar embed for booking\n- Mobile responsive\n\nIntegrations:\n- HubSpot: all 11 gtmos_ custom properties populated after analysis\n- Anysite.io: person enrichment for new contacts, BuiltWith for model routing\n- Anthropic: structured 5-section prompt (ICP, USP, Alpha Signal, Outbound, Content)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01SE727aGBJvRcrG6J49Tz2Y","tree":{"sha":"00ac8aec35167a7bb21368f7b660e34971e866e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/git/trees/00ac8aec35167a7bb21368f7b660e34971e866e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Smoke-Signals-AI/gtm-os-analysis/git/commits/e8862aec845fad8128e5b75f147c8ce324a8ed4f","verification":{"payload":"tree 00ac8aec35167a7bb21368f7b660e34971e866e6\nparent ee772c7a842b5487e3aff54c98d97633b5c56262\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1773107182 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1773107182 +0000\n\nRebuild GTM OS app: Express backend, editorial frontend, full integration layer\n\nReplace Next.js multi-step wizard with a streamlined Express app. Two inputs\n(email + website URL), parallel enrichment/scraping workstreams, AI-powered\nanalysis via Claude (Opus for HubSpot users, Sonnet for others), and a\nmagazine-style editorial results page.\n\nBackend:\n- Express server with SSE progress streaming\n- HubSpot service: contact search/create/update, property management\n- Anysite.io service: LinkedIn enrichment, BuiltWith tech stack check\n- Anthropic service: 5-section GTM analysis with parsed sections\n- Website scraper: homepage + subpage extraction\n- PDF service: branded HTML report with print-to-PDF\n- Input validation, rate limiting (3/email/day), BuiltWith caching (24h TTL)\n\nFrontend:\n- Smoke Signals editorial design system (Inter + Georgia, coral/navy palette)\n- Animated loading states with SSE progress updates\n- Markdown-to-HTML renderer for analysis sections\n- Numbered sections (01-05), pull quotes, data cards\n- HubSpot calendar embed for booking\n- Mobile responsive\n\nIntegrations:\n- HubSpot: all 11 gtmos_ custom properties populated after analysis\n- Anysite.io: person enrichment for new contacts, BuiltWith for model routing\n- Anthropic: structured 5-section prompt (ICP, USP, Alpha Signal, Outbound, Content)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01SE727aGBJvRcrG6J49Tz2Y\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQK08Ldnj\nbARaYzDotGQbN5myLkCzejKDCiRRRuNaWRMQf1SZ84A1rNFni4qXg1EXBgIC+PJFts7PRJy1h+is\nhgw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-10T01:46:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.git