807/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-18T03:56:57Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-18T03:56:57Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"message":"Fix: Pre-flight skip false positives and PlanExecutor strategy mismatches\n\n- Disable checkExpectedOutcome() — text-based keyword matching against DOM\n  text is fundamentally unreliable and caused unrelated steps to be skipped\n- Fix checkFieldValue() false positives — \"First name\" matched \"Last name\"\n  due to Levenshtein threshold of 0.6; raised to 0.9 with field name\n  normalization (strip punctuation, collapse whitespace)\n- Add resolveStrategy() to PlanExecutor — detects actual element type\n  (select, radio, checkbox) and defers to Hybrid executor on mismatch\n- Add purgeCachedPlan() to PagePlanner — deletes stale cached plans with\n  wrong strategies from chrome.storage.local\n- Fix 60+ TypeScript build errors from type mismatches across modules\n- Redeploy page_planner edge function v1.2.0 with gemini-2.0-flash and\n  forced JSON output (responseMimeType)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5396a00183e74dc30b6a63a0e55a9f15007abb8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/trees/5396a00183e74dc30b6a63a0e55a9f15007abb8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/commits/25333689168e1e55634a92d072f9b88141315807","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97"