athanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/aa6c15fc76ace92c3b77657733046dabf7a394a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-17T23:22:55Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-17T23:22:55Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"message":"Feat: Phase 0+1 — Auth, User Identity, and Team-Ready Foundations\n\nPhase 0: IWorkflowStore interface with swappable singleton, ExecutionLog\nwith structured audit trail, multi-recording merge, skill model extraction,\npage planner, and teaching refinement UI.\n\nPhase 1: Supabase Auth integration with chrome.storage.local session adapter,\nobservable AuthService singleton (signIn/signUp/signOut/getUserId), AuthScreen\noverlay, AuthBadge header component, Account section in Settings, and userId\nwiring into ExecutionLog. Local-first: auth is optional, getUserId() returns\n''local'' when not authenticated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"68e04f1d9bd51712dcdd229578c8f0a114e352d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/trees/68e04f1d9bd51712dcdd229578c8f0a114e352d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/commits/aa6c15fc76ace92c3b77657733046dabf7a394a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_