"committer":{"date":"2026-02-17T19:26:45Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"message":"Docs: Skill-based architecture plan — page planner + enhanced teaching\n\nDescribes the next evolution from step replay to skill-based execution:\n- Two-level planning: skill plan (across pages) + page plan (per page)\n- AI thinks once per page, code executes per step (3 LLM calls vs 8-12)\n- Enhanced teaching: form audits, negative space tracking, multi-recording merge\n- Plan caching for near-zero LLM calls after 5+ runs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd8486f61991b635651c618c9c8cc95c63c457bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/trees/fd8486f61991b635651c618c9c8cc95c63c457bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/commits/f0cbd4be189a721115adc488614508fce1614370","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/f0cbd4be189a721115adc488614508fce1614370","node_id":"C_kwDOQkZeDdoAKGYwY2JkNGJlMTg5YTcyMTExNWFkYzQ4ODYxNDUwOGZjZTE2MTQzNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/4315ff43f53c2a8b698e486d1b06bffcee515b96","sha":"4315ff43f53c2a8b698e486d1b06bffcee515b96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/4315ff43f53c2a8b698e486d1b06bffcee515b96"}],"sha":"f0cbd4be189a721115adc488614508fce1614370","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/f0cbd4be189a721115adc488614508fce1614370"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/4315ff43f53c2a8b698e486d1b06bffcee515b96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-17T19:10:07Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-17T19:10:07Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"message":"Feat: Implement full agent evolution plan (Phases 0-5)\n\nEvolves the AI agent from smart replayer to trained employee across 6 phases:\n\n- Phase 0: Close learning loop — recordExecutionComplete() wired after every run,\n  provenStrategies populated, applyProactiveStrategies reads experience data\n- Phase 1: Decompose monolith — extract Observer, GoalChecker from ai-agent.ts\n- Phase 2: Milestone-based execution — MilestoneTracker tracks phases, sends\n  milestone context to dom_agent prompt for phase-aware LLM decisions\n- Phase 3: Adaptive steps — StepAnalyzer builds dependency graph for flexible\n  progression, PreFlightChecker skips pre-filled fields and satisfied outcomes\n- Phase 4: Rich learning — per-step StepReliabilityRecord, hint enrichment with\n  learned corrections, fast-path vs LLM routing based on historical reliability\n- Phase 5: Knows when to ask — ConfidenceAssessor aggregates multi-signal\n  confidence, HelpRequestBuilder generates context-rich help requests with\n  milestone position and confidence breakdown\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d15b002e7dc2058c92ea78aad60213630881cb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/trees/4d15b002e7dc2058c92ea78aad60213630881cb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/commits/4315ff43f53c2a8b698e486d1b06bffcee515b96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/4315ff43f53c2a8b698e486d1b06bffcee515b96","node_id":"C_kwDOQkZeDdoAKDQzMTVmZjQzZjUzYzJhOGI2OThlNDg2ZDFiMDZiZmZjZWU1MTViOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/f259ccad9213c922ca0697de22f8d600246e2fec","sha":"f259ccad9213c922ca0697de22f8d600246e2fec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/f259ccad9213c922ca0697de22f8d600246e2fec"}],"sha":"4315ff43f53c2a8b698e486d1b06bffcee515b96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/4315ff43f53c2a8b698e486d1b06bffcee515b96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/f259ccad9213c922ca0697de22f8d600246e2fec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-30T05:04:31Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-30T05:04:31Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"message":"Feat: Implement Intelligent Agent Phase 3 - Smart Step Outcome Verification\n\nAdds per-step outcome verification using structured successCriteria and\nexpectedOutcome text fallback. Pure DOM/URL checks (~25-35ms per step),\nno LLM calls. Hooked into fast-path, vision dropdown, and LLM-driven\ncompletion points with conservative retry logic. Feature-flagged OFF\nby default (INTELLIGENT_AGENT_STEP_VERIFY).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0956522cd72da834cf877da83ba619f3358f7c86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/trees/0956522cd72da834cf877da83ba619f3358f7c86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/commits/f259ccad9213c922ca0697de22f8d600246e2fec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/f259ccad9213c922ca0697de22f8d600246e2fec","node_id":"C_kwDOQkZeDdoAKGYyNTljY2FkOTIxM2M5MjJjYTA2OTdkZTIyZjhkNjAwMjQ2ZTJmZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/50a37218ce83a912e30535137dad5f13b0dafbfe","sha":"50a37218ce83a912e30535137dad5f13b0dafbfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/50a37218ce83a912e30535137dad5f13b0dafbfe"}],"sha":"f259ccad9213c922ca0697de22f8d600246e2fec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/f259ccad9213c922ca0697de22f8d600246e2fec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/50a37218ce83a912e30535137dad5f13b0dafbfe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-30T03:55:01Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"nathanhui97"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-30T03:55:01Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"nathanhui97"},"message":"Feat: Implement Intelligent Agent Phase 2B - Goal-Oriented Prompting\n\nTransform LLM prompt from \"follow hints strictly\" to \"achieve the goal\nusing hints as guidance.\" All changes gated behind INTELLIGENT_AGENT_GOAL\nfeature flag (disabled by default, no behavior change until enabled).\n\n- Goal-oriented system framing with 4-step decision framework\n- Steps header: \"Recorded Steps (GUIDANCE)\" instead of \"Steps to Complete\"\n- Current focus: \"SUGGESTED NEXT STEP\" with goal-oriented reasoning block\n- Extracted buildCandidatesInstruction() helper; goal-first \"THINK STEP BY STEP\"\n  framework without bias toward picking candidates\n- Your Task reasoning protocol and GOAL-ORIENTED priority with early done support\n- 41 new Phase 2B unit tests (115 total intelligent agent tests passing)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"876484e296f77f279f169d31689b3e263632e0de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/trees/876484e296f77f279f169d31689b3e263632e0de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/commits/50a37218ce83a912e30535137dad5f13b0dafbfe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/50a37218ce83a912e30535137dad5f13b0dafbfe","node_id":"C_kwDOQkZeDdoAKDUwYTM3MjE4Y2U4M2E5MTJlMzA1MzUxMzdkYWQ1ZjEzYjBkYWZiZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/1849b263bd433bf5ce8832454a9b7c70cbdb9edd","sha":"1849b263bd433bf5ce8832454a9b7c70cbdb9edd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/1849b263bd433bf5ce8832454a9b7c70cbdb9edd"}],"sha":"50a37218ce83a912e30535137dad5f13b0dafbfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/50a37218ce83a912e30535137dad5f13b0dafbfe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/1849b263bd433bf5ce8832454a9b7c70cbdb9edd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-29T04:31:06Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-29T04:31:06Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"message":"Feat: Implement Intelligent Agent Phase 2A - Flexible LLM Responses\n\nAllow the LLM to return scroll, wait, skip, or done actions even when\ncandidates exist, instead of being forced to pick a chooseCandidateIndex.\nThis lets the agent recover when elements are off-screen, hints are\nalready satisfied, or the goal is achieved early.\n\nChanges:\n- dom_agent: Add allowFlexibleResponses flag, conditional flexible prompt\n  (Options A-E), relax candidate enforcement in parseGeminiResponse\n- ai-agent: Pass flag in think() payload, log flexible actions, treat\n  scroll/wait as intermediate in detectIntermediateAction()\n- feature-flags: Enable INTELLIGENT_AGENT_FLEXIBLE\n- Tests: 46 new unit tests for Phase 2A (all passing)\n- Docs: Update tracker and upgrade plan\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c1987cea9c0d74ff971fe9f9552006c99c95a6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/trees/7c1987cea9c0d74ff971fe9f9552006c99c95a6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/commits/1849b263bd433bf5ce8832454a9b7c70cbdb9edd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/1849b263bd433bf5ce8832454a9b7c70cbdb9edd","node_id":"C_kwDOQkZeDdoAKDE4NDliMjYzYmQ0MzNiZjVjZTg4MzI0NTRhOWI3YzcwY2JkYjllZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/1869750fee23765bd91f59ad9c6bfc40747e3578","sha":"1869750fee23765bd91f59ad9c6bfc40747e3578","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/1869750fee23765bd91f59ad9c6bfc40747e3578"}],"sha":"1849b263bd433bf5ce8832454a9b7c70cbdb9edd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/1849b263bd433bf5ce8832454a9b7c70cbdb9edd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/1869750fee23765bd91f59ad9c6bfc40747e3578/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-29T04:03:09Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-29T04:03:09Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"message":"Fix: Native <select> dropdown execution and scroll retry loop\n\n- Allow SELECT actions through tryFastPathExecute() gate so instantExecute()\n  handles <select> elements directly (finds element, matches option, sets value)\n- Fix infinite scroll retry by only continuing when scroll actually finds the\n  element, not just when scroll was attempted\n- Tighten shouldTryScroll condition to skip scrolling for medium+ confidence\n  (50%+) where candidates exist but need LLM disambiguation\n- Add text match confidence factor (+15pts) when top candidate''s text exactly\n  matches hint target, boosting checkbox/radio clicks past the 70% fast-path\n  threshold\n- Add LLM parse failure retry (up to 2 attempts) instead of immediate\n  termination on edge function JSON parse errors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0506b2df4792dd399aec03a9a62b1d1dede6f756","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/trees/0506b2df4792dd399aec03a9a62b1d1dede6f756"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/commits/1869750fee23765bd91f59ad9c6bfc40747e3578","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/1869750fee23765bd91f59ad9c6bfc40747e3578","node_id":"C_kwDOQkZeDdoAKDE4Njk3NTBmZWUyMzc2NWJkOTFmNTlhZDljNmJmYzQwNzQ3ZTM1Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/b4c7faae42de419eea95c1548b30758ca35a53ab","sha":"b4c7faae42de419eea95c1548b30758ca35a53ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/b4c7faae42de419eea95c1548b30758ca35a53ab"}],"sha":"1869750fee23765bd91f59ad9c6bfc40747e3578","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/1869750fee23765bd91f59ad9c6bfc40747e3578"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/b4c7faae42de419eea95c1548b30758ca35a53ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-28T05:02:31Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-28T05:02:31Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"message":"Fix: Universal SELECT/Radio/Checkbox handling for variable detection\n\n## Issues Fixed\n\n1. **Infinite Loop Bug**\n   - AIAgent → ExecutionCoordinator → AIAgent was causing infinite recursion\n   - Added `skipUnifiedExecution` flag to break the cycle\n\n2. **Native SELECT Handling**\n   - Clicking on <option> inside <select> no longer records duplicate CLICK step\n   - Only the change event is recorded as INPUT with proper decisionSpace/options\n   - Fast-path execution now handles SELECT elements correctly\n\n3. **Radio Button Groups**\n   - Now captures all radio buttons with same `name` attribute\n   - Captures group label from <fieldset> <legend> or parent container\n   - Variable shows \"Gender\" instead of \"Other\" in the input form\n\n4. **Checkbox Groups**\n   - Now captures all checkboxes in same group (same name or fieldset)\n   - Captures group label for proper variable naming\n   - Shows \"Choose applicable options\" instead of \"Option 1\"\n\n## Files Changed\n\n- `element-finder.ts` - Skip native <option> in isListItemOrOption()\n- `recording-manager.ts` - Radio/checkbox group detection with groupLabel\n- `context-scanner.ts` - Updated DecisionSpace type for RADIO/CHECKBOX\n- `ai-agent.ts` - SELECT handling in fast-path, skipUnifiedExecution flag\n- `coordinator.ts` - Pass skipUnifiedExecution to prevent loop\n- `hint-extractor.ts` - Detect SELECT elements, fix description\n- `variable-detector.ts` - Use groupLabel for field names\n- `App.tsx` - Show \"Select\" instead of \"Type\" for dropdowns\n- `types/ai.ts`, `types/workflow.ts` - New decisionSpace types\n\n## Where We Left Off\n\nThe SELECT/dropdown variable detection is now working. Radio button and\ncheckbox group detection has been implemented but needs testing:\n\n1. Test recording a form with radio buttons (e.g., Gender: Male/Female/Other)\n2. Test recording a form with checkboxes (e.g., Choose options: 1/2/3)\n3. Verify the variable input form shows correct group labels\n4. Verify the options dropdown appears when executing workflows\n\nNext steps if issues persist:\n- Check if groupLabel is being captured in logs\n- Verify decisionSpace.type is RADIO_GROUP or CHECKBOX_GROUP\n- Check VariableDetector logs for fieldName derivation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca18664be79413db467816f6704e9d6fabeedd91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/trees/ca18664be79413db467816f6704e9d6fabeedd91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/commits/b4c7faae42de419eea95c1548b30758ca35a53ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/b4c7faae42de419eea95c1548b30758ca35a53ab","node_id":"C_kwDOQkZeDdoAKGI0YzdmYWFlNDJkZTQxOWVlYTk1YzE1NDhiMzA3NThjYTM1YTUzYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/1fd97e1dd35a0841173237fbf809f7dd4b913152","sha":"1fd97e1dd35a0841173237fbf809f7dd4b913152","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/1fd97e1dd35a0841173237fbf809f7dd4b913152"}],"sha":"b4c7faae42de419eea95c1548b30758ca35a53ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/b4c7faae42de419eea95c1548b30758ca35a53ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/1fd97e1dd35a0841173237fbf809f7dd4b913152/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-28T02:34:05Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"nathanhui97"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-28T02:34:05Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"nathanhui97"},"message":"Feat: Implement Intelligent Agent Phase 1 - Fast-Path Context\n\nImplement Phase 1 of the Intelligent Agent upgrade, which passes execution\ncontext from fast-path attempts to the LLM when fallback is needed.\n\nChanges:\n- Add ExecutionContext interface to track fast-path execution details\n- Capture strategies tried, confidence levels, and call reasons\n- Pass context to dom_agent when LLM fallback is triggered\n- Add feature flags for phased rollout (INTELLIGENT_AGENT_CONTEXT enabled)\n- Add comprehensive tests (28 new tests for intelligent agent)\n- Fix TypeScript errors in coordinator and recovery tests\n\nThe LLM now knows what was already tried, enabling smarter decisions\ninstead of repeating failed approaches.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1933289ff678ff7e35da7b560a61f91126ce2cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/trees/b1933289ff678ff7e35da7b560a61f91126ce2cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/commits/1fd97e1dd35a0841173237fbf809f7dd4b913152","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"htt