tration, triggers, experience\n- skill-view.ts: getSkill() function that extracts Skill from SavedWorkflow\n- skill-storage.ts: CRUD operations for skills via WorkflowStorage\n- skill-index.ts: Fast lookup by triggers, domain, application\n\nKey features:\n- Skill is a VIEW over SavedWorkflow, not a separate storage format\n- Consolidates WorkflowMemory + SavedWorkflow fields into execution-focused structure\n- Supports skill matching via phrase maps and word similarity\n- Track execution experience and user corrections\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"268f9bcc13ad86a14758257ddbba30ea1cf1812a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/trees/268f9bcc13ad86a14758257ddbba30ea1cf1812a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/commits/5df36ae89da85424aff74f0414aebdcc9f12f6eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/5