"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/61e0d2d89c8801abd88d6996f865f8699b59fec6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T17:50:59Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T17:50:59Z","email":"nathanhui97@gmail.com","name":"Your Name"},"message":"Add block-based workflow architecture with unified AI analysis\n\nMajor changes:\n- Block system: Workflows now have typed blocks (form_fill, table_row,\n  list_item, menu_navigation, one_time, submission) with loop support\n- Unified AI: Single endpoint (generate_workflow_memory) now produces\n  both WorkflowAnalysis and WorkflowMemory in one call (was 2 calls)\n- Array variables: Variables can now accept multiple values like\n  \"add Alice, Bob, Carol\" and blocks iterate for each item\n\nNew features:\n- Block execution with iteration: executeWorkflowWithBlocks() handles\n  repeating blocks for multi-item operations\n- Loop context variables: {{current_item}}, {{current_index}}, {{total_items}}\n- Block visualization in UI: Shows block types, repeatability badges,\n  iteration variables, and execution preview\n\nRemoved:\n- Extract Skills button and skill-extractor.ts (replaced by blocks)\n- SkillBoundaryEditor.tsx (no longer needed)\n- analyze_workflow edge function (merged into generate_workflow_memory)\n\nPerformance:\n- Reduced AI calls from 2-3 to 1 per workflow save\n- Storage no longer triggers redundant background AI enhancement\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3ac94279b314c5cbd4ab7023e3edc38ae63fcb9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/tr