tep count when analysis exists\n- Add AI Analysis summary section showing:\n  - Primary goal and domain\n  - Detected patterns (search-and-select, form-fill, etc.)\n  - Adaptation readiness summary\n- Add expandable AI insight cards for each step showing:\n  - Why this element was chosen\n  - Expected outcome\n  - Element finding strategy\n  - Criticality level and dependencies\n- Purple color scheme for AI-related UI elements\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a250dad926d1c51b1aa55434c27f897fb90eef07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/trees/a250dad926d1c51b1aa55434c27f897fb90eef07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/commits/69be2daec96372216f0e6a808f032913478f8d70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/69be2daec96372216f0e6a808f032913478f8d70","node_id":"C_kwDOQkZeDdoAKDY5YmUyZGFlYzk2MzcyMjE2ZjBlN