elationship graph (labels, triggers, controls)\n- Expectation engine for predictive verification\n- Recording integration for rich context capture\n\nPost-Recording AI Analyzer (src/lib/post-recording-analyzer.ts):\n- Step-by-step execution guidance with intent and strategies\n- Pattern detection (search-and-select, form-fill, CRUD)\n- Adaptation strategies for handling UI changes\n- Runs in background after recording stops\n\nIntegration:\n- CandidateFinder enhanced with PageModel context scoring\n- Tier1Executor uses expectation-based verification\n- AI Agent observes through PageModel\n- Recording captures page context, relationships, alternatives\n- aiAnalysis field added to SavedWorkflow\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"89c26a5313f78f0adee96d33b4c441a79237f7c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/trees/89c26a5313f78f0adee96d33b4c441a79237f7c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/commits/c95dc920c1deae69cf96191c281f594ba3ea8e0f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users