:"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/762feba34e76f5d5e3194bbee009de8d5acea154","node_id":"C_kwDOQkZeDdoAKDc2MmZlYmEzNGU3NmY1ZDVlMzE5NGJiZWUwMDlkZThkNWFjZWExNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commit/900a5adcb2e6d08216ef652d98e0436be390bb69","sha":"900a5adcb2e6d08216ef652d98e0436be390bb69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/900a5adcb2e6d08216ef652d98e0436be390bb69"}],"sha":"762feba34e76f5d5e3194bbee009de8d5acea154","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/762feba34e76f5d5e3194bbee009de8d5acea154"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199547302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathanhui97","id":199547302,"login":"nathanhui97","node_id":"U_kgDOC-TZpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanhui97","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/commits/900a5adcb2e6d08216ef652d98e0436be390bb69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-10T02:10:21Z","email":"nathanhui97@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nathanhui97"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-10T02:10:21Z","email":"nathanhui97@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nathanhui97"},"message":"Implement unified interaction detection and workflow optimization\n\nMajor architectural improvements to stabilize recording and execution:\n\n**Unified Interaction Detector**\n- Centralized detection of interaction types (dropdown, text input, checkbox, etc.)\n- Eliminates fragmented detection logic across 5+ modules\n- Uses web standards (ARIA roles, semantic HTML) for universal compatibility\n- Single source of truth: detect once during recording, read everywhere\n- Navigation menu vs dropdown distinction (Salesforce nav links no longer misclassified)\n- Shadow DOM input detection via capturedInputDetails\n\n**Workflow Optimization**\n- INPUT step consolidation: \"n\" → \"nath\" → \"nathan\" becomes single step\n- SCROLL event consolidation: 7 scroll events become 1-2 scrolls\n- 50%+ reduction in step count (19 steps → 8-9 optimized steps)\n- Non-destructive: preserves original steps for debugging\n\n**AI Label Enhancement**\n- New Edge Function for async AI-powered label extraction\n- Fallback for complex Shadow DOM inputs where DOM detection fails\n- Client service with batching and retry logic\n\n**Test Improvements**\n- Fixed 3/4 failing Tier1Executor tests\n- 17/18 tests now passing (1 skipped due to test environment limitations)\n- Better mocking for isolated unit tests\n\n**Files Changed**\n- New: interaction-detector.ts, dropdown-option-scanner.ts, ai-label-enhancer.ts\n- New: supabase/functions/extract_field_label/\n- Updated: recording-manager, variable-detector, hint-extractor, tier1-executor\n- Documentation: 3 new MD files explaining changes\n\nThis stabilizes the in-flight work for Phase 1 of the CRM hardening plan.","tree":{"sha":"ff002e7f40f147a383094f07e336df56e622e8da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/trees/ff002e7f40f147a383094f07e336df56e622e8da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanhui97/Mimoai/git/commits/900a5adcb2e6d08216ef652d98e0436be390bb69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committ