jA0NWZkYWI0YzE3MDZmMTM0N2VhNDI5OTJkNmM5MmNjNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/commit/575179efa5f809698ba3a16b5324b4c5e54ca1cb","sha":"575179efa5f809698ba3a16b5324b4c5e54ca1cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/commits/575179efa5f809698ba3a16b5324b4c5e54ca1cb"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/commit/b4f210b1291173bf79ad26f8a131c3c78ef9d62f","sha":"b4f210b1291173bf79ad26f8a131c3c78ef9d62f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/commits/b4f210b1291173bf79ad26f8a131c3c78ef9d62f"}],"sha":"4a9eb2045fdab4c1706f1347ea42992d6c92cc40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/commits/4a9eb2045fdab4c1706f1347ea42992d6c92cc40"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/187029011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhiHungVo00","id":187029011,"login":"PhiHungVo00","node_id":"U_kgDOCyXWEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/commits/b4f210b1291173bf79ad26f8a131c3c78ef9d62f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T11:09:48Z","email":"23520582@gm.uit.edu.vn","name":"Võ Phi Hùng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T11:09:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #3 from PhiHungVo00/devin/1780051718-phase1-phase2-complete-fixes-and-features\n\n* feat: Phase 1 bug fixes + Phase 2 features implementation\n\nPhase 1 - Critical Bug Fixes:\n1. Fix Auth Flow - enforce JWT_SECRET from env, cross-origin cookie settings\n2. Fix GraphQL tenantId leak - add context injection, filter by tenantId\n3. Fix Security - CORS whitelist, Socket.IO CORS whitelist\n4. Fix Performance - Redis SCAN cursor-based, Product.aggregate\n5. Fix Hardcoded URLs - centralized API_BASE across all MFE apps\n6. Fix Docker Compose - missing services, env vars, depends_on\n7. Fix RabbitMQ - exponential backoff reconnection logic\n8. Fix Socket.IO memory leak - verified useRef cleanup\n9. Fix MFE Registry duplicate seed block removed\n10. Fix Module System - CommonJS to TypeScript (auth, cart, orders, Order model)\n\nPhase 2 - Features:\n11. Product Variants System - model, schema, UI selector\n12. Product Image Gallery - images array, carousel UI\n13. Inventory/Stock Management - stock check, atomic decrement, out-of-stock badge\n14. Order Status Management - admin order list with status updates\n15. Address Book Management - CRUD addresses, profile tab\n16. Voucher/Coupon System - apply voucher at cart checkout\n17. Category Tree - multi-level categories with parent refs\n18. Advanced Search Filters - price range, rating, sort options\n19. Shipping Address in Order - full checkout form\n20. Responsive/Mobile Layout - media queries, flex-wrap nav\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: address Devin Review findings\n\n- Cart total clamped to Math.max(0, ...) to prevent negative totals\n- Auth middleware returns 401 when user not found in DB instead of calling next()\n- Reset selectedImage/selectedVariant when navigating between products\n- Category delete now recursively removes all descendants, not just direct children\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Phi Hùng Võ <hungvo22082005@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"dfd86f28c8782d7ddc087be341fd95fc27b5f4ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/git/trees/dfd86f28c8782d7ddc087be341fd95fc27b5f4ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/git/commits/b4f210b1291173bf79ad26f8a131c3c78ef9d62f","verification":{"payload":"tree dfd86f28c8782d7ddc087be341fd95fc27b5f4ab\nparent 575179efa5f809698ba3a16b5324b4c5e54ca1cb\nparent 39976b6b4e74d22623e49530a3ac957565e27ebe\nauthor Võ Phi Hùng <23520582@gm.uit.edu.vn> 1780052988 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780052988 +0700\n\nMerge pull request #3 from PhiHungVo00/devin/1780051718-phase1-phase2-complete-fixes-and-features\n\n* feat: Phase 1 bug fixes + Phase 2 features implementation\n\nPhase 1 - Critical Bug Fixes:\n1. Fix Auth Flow - enforce JWT_SECRET from env, cross-origin cookie settings\n2. Fix GraphQL tenantId leak - add context injection, filter by tenantId\n3. Fix Security - CORS whitelist, Socket.IO CORS whitelist\n4. Fix Performance - Redis SCAN cursor-based, Product.aggregate\n5. Fix Hardcoded URLs - centralized API_BASE across all MFE apps\n6. Fix Docker Compose - missing services, env vars, depends_on\n7. Fix RabbitMQ - exponential backoff reconnection logic\n8. Fix Socket.IO memory leak - verified useRef cleanup\n9. Fix MFE Registry duplicate seed block removed\n10. Fix Module System - CommonJS to TypeScript (auth, cart, orders, Order model)\n\nPhase 2 - Features:\n11. Product Variants System - model, schema, UI selector\n12. Product Image Gallery - images array, carousel UI\n13. Inventory/Stock Management - stock check, atomic decrement, out-of-stock badge\n14. Order Status Management - admin order list with status updates\n15. Address Book Management - CRUD addresses, profile tab\n16. Voucher/Coupon System - apply voucher at cart checkout\n17. Category Tree - multi-level categories with parent refs\n18. Advanced Search Filters - price range, rating, sort options\n19. Shipping Address in Order - full checkout form\n20. Responsive/Mobile Layout - media queries, flex-wrap nav\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: address Devin Review findings\n\n- Cart total clamped to Math.max(0, ...) to prevent negative totals\n- Auth middleware returns 401 when user not found in DB instead of calling next()\n- Reset selectedImage/selectedVariant when navigating between products\n- Category delete now recursively removes all descendants, not just direct children\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Phi Hùng Võ <hungvo22082005@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqGXP8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtIcQAH4wKj6xHS9xQhKQXOdvhGE4\n+SyTufSPTAwhX18ZnUiB94VtxOCpAVEPbKKhScH6waUxwq/XKaj93iygxVSEorxe\nqsY6WDY3w6dgfl1y/8TNaajb0ECizNnmVdiASwXIXQDRCGTOJR7Yc2U467+YyqDb\nVMYtOz/DR8Bivm8wuCwsGhz3O+FqUovn+mr3pQPXrWNDBiVfR6Ew1C87LQMyr6Ia\nlFk2vtzZKlh0gf+LEXn7fyZhDjmBBL9kcZBCsHImyuAUGqirNj8TBHtNtB0JeLwT\nPHzduO6S31kyPgkqcQXIw3iHZNqhl2q9TlCgFIsVZpIJ/VPJvr6J93wMooQFc4Cm\njC8NayI9NPnsFIJ/usZYrVc1SRyODkg4tjMmETE5ZBxO9JjOHP5eIoLtEOi9qW45\nwaRbMOmXmFPVvLE5P4GEWL7aAwjQQhdZL0aUCnpMePyyL4KGRT3DhLJClYHoWyGM\nQbLpChinS6/6eBhCPMhyfPNthv/Xt/of91YCyUSCTFJ/ZyrbPJ2tTgQmUNRyz1EW\nBPe4xmX5xEfuGsv1ApqrNnSzQNDABm0KzmUVErpb19ynfJvtbE4xeuh8MWKTi7XT\nywZwSHqO0VhPL5DLGsXvQhEW6TKaUmSqSUSuljIw0LUQsZX+rfOYV+P6ErB1VpvY\nZ4sjKRvnZh85jl+983P3\n=3o2R\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-29T11:09:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_ur