//api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/commit/575179efa5f809698ba3a16b5324b4c5e54ca1cb","node_id":"C_kwDOQkej19oAKDU3NTE3OWVmYTVmODA5Njk4YmEzYTE2YjUzMjRiNGM1ZTU0Y2ExY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/commit/45cdeb646b29e7c8fbb988d2726f5577cebdfc20","sha":"45cdeb646b29e7c8fbb988d2726f5577cebdfc20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/commits/45cdeb646b29e7c8fbb988d2726f5577cebdfc20"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/commit/3661aa5245f451c3a1d969b1e3bc32740cd30777","sha":"3661aa5245f451c3a1d969b1e3bc32740cd30777","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/commits/3661aa5245f451c3a1d969b1e3bc32740cd30777"}],"sha":"575179efa5f809698ba3a16b5324b4c5e54ca1cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/commits/575179efa5f809698ba3a16b5324b4c5e54ca1cb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/187029011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhiHungVo00","id":187029011,"login":"PhiHungVo00","node_id":"U_kgDOCyXWEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungVo00","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/commits/3661aa5245f451c3a1d969b1e3bc32740cd30777/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T10:30:27Z","email":"23520582@gm.uit.edu.vn","name":"Võ Phi Hùng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T10:30:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #2 from PhiHungVo00/devin/1780043622-shopee-features\n\n* feat: add Shopee-style features - bug fixes, order management, wishlist, filters, vouchers, stock tracking\n\nBug Fixes:\n- Fix AuthContext token persistence (login/register/me now return token)\n- Fix hardcoded production URLs in cart-app, profile-app, admin-app, support-app\n- Fix Cart.jsx Socket.IO memory leak (moved to useEffect with cleanup)\n- Fix CJS/ESM interop in auth.js, cart.js, orders.js routes\n\nNew Features:\n- Admin Order Management page (view all orders, filter by status, update status)\n- Order Tracking Timeline in profile (Shopee-style step indicator)\n- Wishlist page with heart toggle on product cards\n- Product filters & sort (price range, sort by newest/price/rating/popular)\n- Profile Settings with edit name and change password\n- Inventory/stock management (countInStock field, Out of Stock badge, low stock warning)\n- Backend-driven Voucher system (CRUD, claim, apply with validation)\n- Enhanced navbar with Wishlist link\n- Stock decrement on order creation\n\nBackend Changes:\n- New Voucher model and routes (GET /api/vouchers, POST claim, POST apply, POST create)\n- New auth routes (PUT /api/auth/profile, PUT /api/auth/password)\n- New admin order routes (GET /api/orders, GET /api/orders/:id, PUT /api/orders/:id/status)\n- Enhanced GET /api/products with price/rating filters and sort options\n- GraphQL schema updated with countInStock field\n- Voucher seed data (FREESHIP, TECH10, WELCOME15, FLASH30)\n\nFrontend Changes:\n- OrderManager component for admin-app\n- WishlistPage component exposed via Module Federation\n- VoucherWallet now fetches from backend API\n- ProductList with sort dropdown and price range inputs\n- UserProfile with order timeline and account settings tabs\n- All apps use dynamic API_BASE (localhost vs production)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: address Devin Review findings from PR #1\n\n- Use nullish coalescing (??) instead of || for product update fields\n  (prevents silently ignoring price=0 or empty string values)\n- Add individual product cache invalidation on PUT and DELETE\n  (clearCache product:${id} alongside products:* to prevent stale GraphQL reads)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: address 5 Devin Review findings - stock safety, filters, order cancel restore\n\n1. Stock not restored on cancel: Save previousStatus, restore countInStock when transitioning to Canceled\n2. Sort/price filters non-functional: Add getAllFiltered REST API method, use when filters active\n3. for...of on undefined orderItems: Change validation to !orderItems || orderItems.length === 0\n4. Stale orders closure: Use functional setOrders(prev => prev.map(...)) in OrderManager\n5. Negative stock: Pre-check availability, use atomic conditional update with rollback on race\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: add testing skill and update package-lock.json\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Phi Hùng Võ <hungvo22082005@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab1fdc250987cab002a0b5a76ab06df737090cc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/git/trees/ab1fdc250987cab002a0b5a76ab06df737090cc8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/git/commits/3661aa5245f451c3a1d969b1e3bc32740cd30777","verification":{"payload":"tree ab1fdc250987cab002a0b5a76ab06df737090cc8\nparent 45cdeb646b29e7c8fbb988d2726f5577cebdfc20\nparent df34024e7b30fd868100289ba3bbebd4d656684c\nauthor Võ Phi Hùng <23520582@gm.uit.edu.vn> 1780050627 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780050627 +0700\n\nMerge pull request #2 from PhiHungVo00/devin/1780043622-shopee-features\n\n* feat: add Shopee-style features - bug fixes, order management, wishlist, filters, vouchers, stock tracking\n\nBug Fixes:\n- Fix AuthContext token persistence (login/register/me now return token)\n- Fix hardcoded production URLs in cart-app, profile-app, admin-app, support-app\n- Fix Cart.jsx Socket.IO memory leak (moved to useEffect with cleanup)\n- Fix CJS/ESM interop in auth.js, cart.js, orders.js routes\n\nNew Features:\n- Admin Order Management page (view all orders, filter by status, update status)\n- Order Tracking Timeline in profile (Shopee-style step indicator)\n- Wishlist page with heart toggle on product cards\n- Product filters & sort (price range, sort by newest/price/rating/popular)\n- Profile Settings with edit name and change password\n- Inventory/stock management (countInStock field, Out of Stock badge, low stock warning)\n- Backend-driven Voucher system (CRUD, claim, apply with validation)\n- Enhanced navbar with Wishlist link\n- Stock decrement on order creation\n\nBackend Changes:\n- New Voucher model and routes (GET /api/vouchers, POST claim, POST apply, POST create)\n- New auth routes (PUT /api/auth/profile, PUT /api/auth/password)\n- New admin order routes (GET /api/orders, GET /api/orders/:id, PUT /api/orders/:id/status)\n- Enhanced GET /api/products with price/rating filters and sort options\n- GraphQL schema updated with countInStock field\n- Voucher seed data (FREESHIP, TECH10, WELCOME15, FLASH30)\n\nFrontend Changes:\n- OrderManager component for admin-app\n- WishlistPage component exposed via Module Federation\n- VoucherWallet now fetches from backend API\n- ProductList with sort dropdown and price range inputs\n- UserProfile with order timeline and account settings tabs\n- All apps use dynamic API_BASE (localhost vs production)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: address Devin Review findings from PR #1\n\n- Use nullish coalescing (??) instead of || for product update fields\n  (prevents silently ignoring price=0 or empty string values)\n- Add individual product cache invalidation on PUT and DELETE\n  (clearCache product:${id} alongside products:* to prevent stale GraphQL reads)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: address 5 Devin Review findings - stock safety, filters, order cancel restore\n\n1. Stock not restored on cancel: Save previousStatus, restore countInStock when transitioning to Canceled\n2. Sort/price filters non-functional: Add getAllFiltered REST API method, use when filters active\n3. for...of on undefined orderItems: Change validation to !orderItems || orderItems.length === 0\n4. Stale orders closure: Use functional setOrders(prev => prev.map(...)) in OrderManager\n5. Negative stock: Pre-check availability, use atomic conditional update with rollback on race\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: add testing skill and update package-lock.json\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Phi Hùng Võ <hungvo22082005@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","rea