ttps://api.github.com/repos/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/commits/6f5271da01bf998dd136b6ffe83366b2e6f98a5f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142214340?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungfVox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungfVox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungfVox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungfVox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhiHungfVox","id":142214340,"login":"PhiHungfVox","node_id":"U_kgDOCHoExA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungfVox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungfVox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungfVox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungfVox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungfVox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungfVox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/commits/a0d005286e27c8f3d6e518d3d3789ba539984420/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T08:42:23Z","email":"hungvo22082005@gmail.com","name":"Phi Hùng Võ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T08:42:23Z","email":"hungvo22082005@gmail.com","name":"Phi Hùng Võ"},"message":"feat: add Shopee-style features - bug fixes, order management, wishlist, filters, vouchers, stock tracking\n\nBug Fixes:\n- Fix AuthContext token persistence (login/register/me now return token)\n- Fix hardcoded production URLs in cart-app, profile-app, admin-app, support-app\n- Fix Cart.jsx Socket.IO memory leak (moved to useEffect with cleanup)\n- Fix CJS/ESM interop in auth.js, cart.js, orders.js routes\n\nNew Features:\n- Admin Order Management page (view all orders, filter by status, update status)\n- Order Tracking Timeline in profile (Shopee-style step indicator)\n- Wishlist page with heart toggle on product cards\n- Product filters & sort (price range, sort by newest/price/rating/popular)\n- Profile Settings with edit name and change password\n- Inventory/stock management (countInStock field, Out of Stock badge, low stock warning)\n- Backend-driven Voucher system (CRUD, claim, apply with validation)\n- Enhanced navbar with Wishlist link\n- Stock decrement on order creation\n\nBackend Changes:\n- New Voucher model and routes (GET /api/vouchers, POST claim, POST apply, POST create)\n- New auth routes (PUT /api/auth/profile, PUT /api/auth/password)\n- New admin order routes (GET /api/orders, GET /api/orders/:id, PUT /api/orders/:id/status)\n- Enhanced GET /api/products with price/rating filters and sort options\n- GraphQL schema updated with countInStock field\n- Voucher seed data (FREESHIP, TECH10, WELCOME15, FLASH30)\n\nFrontend Changes:\n- OrderManager component for admin-app\n- WishlistPage component exposed via Module Federation\n- VoucherWallet now fetches from backend API\n- ProductList with sort dropdown and price range inputs\n- UserProfile with order timeline and account settings tabs\n- All apps use dynamic API_BASE (localhost vs production)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d2f05037a39dc607ef972ffa11d34a87c19091d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/git/trees/d2f05037a39dc607ef972ffa11d34a87c19091d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hieu200405/Stuffy_Supermarket/git/commits/a0d005286e27c8f3d6e518d3d3789ba539984420","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142214340?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungfVox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhiHungfVox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/u